<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Borna</book>
  <para style="h">Matiwos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matiwos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matiwos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt">Matiwos Guut'tso</para>
  <para style="mt3">Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos Dooshishiyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiwos dooshishiyo, Iyesus b́ weyijango, shin shin jangit keewetso kashitk b́ wottsok'onat Ik'o shin b́ taarts taar shintsotse bí ashuwotssh b́ jangits keewo b́ weeron b́ imtsotse b́ keewit doo shishi aap'ono detstsoniye. Doo shishi aap'onuwere Iyesus bo dagotse shuweyat bí eents ayhudiwots s'uzsh b́ woterawon, dats jamosha b́ tesh.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiwos dooshishyo Matiwos dooshishiyan t'iwintsdek't k'aniyek mas'aafa, Iyesus b́ shuwertsatse tuut b́ gupeyonat b́ fadeyi jango sháánshdek't b́ keewihakon, Geliln b́ nabts nabo, daniyonat kashiyi finoni b́t'intsiri. Manats dabt Geliln tuut Iyerusalem maants b́ sha'ats sha'onat datsanatse b́ teshts dúri s'uwaatsi ik gawyotse wotts keewwotsi tandek't b́keewir, keewanotswere b́ jitewo, b́ k'ironat k'iro da'at b́two detskno.</para>
  <para style="ip">Doo shishiyan Iyesusi, Ik'i nemo bitsosh al detstsonat Ik'i mengsti jango daniyi danif eeno b́ wottsok'o woshdek'tni b́t'ints. B́ danif danwotsitse ayuwotswere k'osh k'osh naarotse kakuwere útsok kayiyekno.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Ik'i mengsti ashuwots doyo, fino, bo detsts mebtiyo, boatse koteetkewonat dúri s'uwatse boon kotiru gowo daniyiru gúúratse nabetso (k'ot' 5-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">2. B́ danif tatse gitwots doo shishyi keewosh boon woshetsok'on boosh imets nemwotsi (k'ot' 10)</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Ik'i mengsti jangosh t'ints k'osh k'osh naaron ariyets jewrwots (k'ot' 13).</para>
  <para style="ip">4. B́ danifwotsi etirwi biitso kitsiru dano (k'ot' 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">5. And dúri s'uwonat Ik'i mengsti weyi jangosh imets dano (k'ot' 24-25)</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus Krstos naari s'oot'onat b́shwewon 1:1—2:23</para>
  <para style="io1">Gupfo Yohans fino 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus b́ gupewonat b́ fadewon 3:13—4:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyesus b́fiino Geliln dek't b́tuutsok'owo 4:12—18:35</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelilen tuut Iyerusalemits 19:1—20:34</para>
  <para style="io1">S'uwaatsi ik gawiyotse Iyerusalemnat b gúúratse 21:1—27:66</para>
  <para style="io1">Nodoonz k'iro da'adek't b́ tuutsk'onat b́ be'etsok'on 28:1-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Krstos shuwets s'oot'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk'. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Dub. 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Dawitnat Abrahamn naar wottso Iyesus Krstos shuweyi s'ap'o haniye.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abraham Yisak'i b́shuwi, Yisak' Yak'obi b́shuwi, Yak'ob Yihudnat bí'eshwotsi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yihudwere Faresnat Zaran Timari eteef máátswatse b́shuwi, Fares Hesroni b́shwi, Hesronwere Arami b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Aramu Aminadabi b́shuwi, Aminadabu Ne'asoni b́shuwi, Ne'asonu Selmoni b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Selmon Boezn Reaabi eteets máátswatse b́shuwi, Boez Iyobedn Ruuti eteef máátswatse b́shuwi, Iyobed Iseyi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 4:18-22">Rut. 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 2:13-15">1 Zen. 2:13-15</ref> </char></note> Isey Nugúso Dawiti b́shuwi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Nugúso Dawit Oriyo mááts teshtswatse Selemoni b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Selemon Rob'ami b́shuwi, Rob'am Abiyayi b́shuwi, Abiyawere Asafi b́shuwi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft">Asafnat Asan ikno. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaf Iyosaft'i b́shuwi, Iyosaft' Iyorami b́shuwi, Iyoram Oziyani b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Oziyanwere Iyo'atami b́shuwi, Iyo'atam Akazi b́shuwi, Akaz Hzk'iyasi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hzk'iyas Mnaseyi b́ shuwi, Mnaase Amos'i b́shuwi, Amos' Iyosyasi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2 Naash. 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Zen. 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Erm. 27:20</ref> </char></note> Iyosyas Israe'el ashaasho Babilon maants bo kishodek't damets dúr Ikoniyannat bí'eshwotsi b́shuwi.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Bokisho dek't Babiloni dameyakon Ikoniyan Salatiyal b́ shuwi Selatyal Zerubabeli b́ shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubabel Abiyodi b́shuwi, Abiyodu Eelyak'emi b́shwi, Eelyak'em Azori b́ shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azor Sadok'i b́shuwi, Sadok' Akimi b́shuwi, Akim Eelyudi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eeliyud Alazari b́shuwi, Alazar Matani b́shuwi, Matan Yak'obi b́shuwi, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yak'ob Krstosi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Krstosi: </char><char style="ft">Eto mesihiya wee fuutetsoni etee. </char></note> eteefo Iyesusi shuwtsu Mariyami wid'tso Yosefi b́shuwi.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Eshe Abrahamatse tuut Dawitats b́borfetso tatse awd gubra, Dawitatse tuut kisho dek't Babilonits dameetsok b́borfetso tatse awd gubra, kisho dek't Babiloni dametsatse tuut waa Krstosok b́borfetso tatse awd gubree.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Krstos Shuwewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk'. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luk'. 1:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus Krstos b́shwetsok'o hank'oyi b́tesh, b́ índ Mariyam Yosefsh wid'eyat bbefere, bogonkerawon bi S'ayin shayiron maac'at' bdatseyi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Bin wid'tso Yosef ash kááw b́teshtsotse Maryami ash shinatse kish kitso geeratse, mansh áátson k'azk'ro b́gaw. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Ernmó keewan jango shiyanoke b́befere doonzo melakiyo gúmon bí'ats be'eyat hank'o bíet, «Dawit naaro Yosefo! Nwid'tsu Mariyam bmaac'tso S'ayin shayiron b́wottsotse bin nmoo maants dek'osh shatk'aye. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk'. 1:31</ref> </char></note> Biye nungush na'o shwitwaniye, bí ashuwotsi morrotse b́kashitwotse b́shútso Iyesusi etetune.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Jaman b́wottsonwere doonzo nebiyiyo weeron b́keewtso b́s'eenetwok'owe, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa. 7:14</ref> </char></note> «Hambe, baar na'a s'eenu mac'itwanee, nungush na'onowere shuwitwane, b́ shútsonwere ‹Amanu'eli› err s'eegetwe.» Amanu'eli etonwere «Ik'o nontoniye» etee.<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Yosef tokrotse b́ tuwor, doonzo melakiyo bísh b́keewtsok'on b́ wid'tsu Mariyami b́moomants dek'tbíami. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luk'. 2:21</ref> </char></note> Wotowa eree bna'o bshuufetsosh bin danatse.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aanatse: </char><char style="ft">Eto máátsonat nungushi gonkeyo gokeratse etee. </char></note> B́shútsonowere Iyesusi et b́s'eeg.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Aaw keshon waats k'eeni jango danfwotsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Nugúso Herodis dúr, Yihud datsatse daatseyiru Betelihem kitutse Iyesus b́shuweyiye hakon, k'eeni jango danfwots aaw keshomande Iyerusalem maants boweyi. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Erm. 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek. 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Taaw. 24:17</ref> </char></note> Hank'o etnwere bo aati, «Shuwets Ayhudi nugúso aawoke? B́ k'eeno aawkeshon bek'aat bísh sagadosh waarone.»<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Nugúso man b́shishtsok'on tek' b́wtsi, Iyerusalem ashjamonwere bínton tek'bowtsi, <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Kahni naash jamwotsntonat ashuwotsitse nemo danifwotsi kakudek't, Krstos b́shuwetwo aawk'on b́wottsok'o boon bí aati.<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Bowere hank'o ett bísh bo aaniyi «Nebiyiyon hank'o etts bek'o guut'etsotse, Krstos b́shuwet Yihud datsatse Betelem kitotsnee,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik. 5:2</ref> </char>
    </note> ‹Yihud dats kayotse daatseyiru Betelemee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Ti ash asho Isra'eli korde'er jishitwo n datsatse b́keshetwotse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">Yhuditsi kit een eenwotsiyere eegonoru dasheratsne.› »<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Maniyere il Herodis k'eeni jango danfmanotsi ááshon s'eegidek't, k'eenman awr b́ be'etsok'o arikon aatt danbdek'i. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Hank'o ettnwere Betelem maants boon woshb́k'ri «Amr na'o jango t'iwintsde danere, bín itdatstsok'onowere taawere amr bísh tsagaditwok'o waar taash keewwere.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Bowere Nugúso aap'o booshishihakon kesht boami, eshe! aawkeshon bobek'ts k'eeno na'i marmat'o b́beyirwok b́ned'efetsosh bo shinshinatse sha'efetst boon b́jishi. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>K'eenman bobek'tsok'on ayidek't gene'ubowtsi, <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Mootsowere kindt na'i marmat'o bí'ind Mariyamnton b́befere bobek'i, b́shinats gúp gúp'at bosagadi, bo sat'nonowere k'eshdek't aawntso, it'anonat kerbeya etef shak' shaawo bísh bot'intsi.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Herodis maantsowere bo aanerawok'o Ik'o gúmon boosh b́keewtsotse k'osh weerindon bodatsomand aanat k'azboami.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Na'i marmat'o dek't Gbs'mants boamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>K'eeni jango danfwots boamiyakon, doonzo melakiyo Yosefats gúmon be'eyat, «Herodis na'i marmat'o úd'osh b́geyirwotse, tuur na'i marmat'o indunton de'er Gbs'maand k'ay amee, neesh tkeewfetsonowere manoke betee» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Mann Yosef t'úwon tuut na'i marmato bí índnton dek't Gbs'maand k'az bíami. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos. 11:1</ref> </char></note> Manoknowere Herodis b́k'irfetso b́teshi, man b́wottsonúwere doonzo nebiyiyo weeron «T naayi Gbs' datsatse s'eegree» bíettso b́s'eenetwok'owe.<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herodis nana'úwotsi b́úd'itsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Herodis maniyere il, k'eeni jango danfwots bín bo ant'elctsok'o t'iwints b́dek'tsok'on, ayidek't b́fayi, bísh kes' kes'fwotsi Betelihemnat bgúratse fa'a gal gal jamwotsmaants woshat, k'eeni jang danfwotsatse b́dúro aatt danb́dek'tsok'on bo nato gitnatonat maniyere dash wottswotsi Betelihemitsnat bgúratse fa'a, beyat teshtswots nungush nana'uwotsi úd'iyb'ishi. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Manoor nebiyiyo Ermiyasn hank'o ett bek'on keewetso b́s'eeni.<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Erm. 31:15</ref> </char>
    </note> «Rahel b nana'úwotssh bieep'fere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">Kuhonat s'aamts eepi k'aaro Ramayitse b́ shisheyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Bnana'uwots kashon bo altsotse kup'dek'o k'azraniye.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gbs'itse Nazret maants aanetsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herodis b́ k'irihakon Doonzo melakiyo Gbs'itse Yosefats gúmon be'eyat, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>«Na'o kasho geyiru ashuwots bo kirtsotsnee tuur na'o indunton de'er Isra'el maants amee» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yosefwere tuut na'o indúnton Isra'elmants dek't bíaani.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Wotowabako Arkelawos b́nih Herodis shegro Yihud datsatse b́ naasho b́shishtsok'on Yosef manmaants amo shat b́gutsi. Eré gúmon bín jishitwo imetsotse Gelil maants bíami. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mar. 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luk'. 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Yoh. 1:45</ref> </char></note> «Nazrawiya eteetwe» ett nebiyiyon keewetso b́s'eenetwok'owo, Naazreti eteef kituts waat be b́wtsi.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohans b́ nabtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar. 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk'. 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh. 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Manoor gupfo Yohans Yhud worwotse nabfere b́weyi. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mat. 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar. 1:15</ref> </char></note> B́daniferowere «Eshe! Ik' mengstu b karntsotse naandrone erere» b́ etfo.<verse eid="MAT 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa. 40:3</ref> </char>
    </note> « ‹Doonzo weerindo k'aniwere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">B́fudonore káátswere!› etfetst worwotse kuhiru asho k'ároniye»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 3:3">ett́ nebiyo Isayas b́keewtso Yohans jangoni b́teh.<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Naash. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:4">Zek. 13:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 11:22">Lew. 11:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Yohans taho kambli s'iron wozeka b́tesh, b́gebatsowere shaak'a bí edefo, b́ máfonwere p'elonat dok'shi mas'a b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Manoor Iyerusalemitse Yhud dats jamatse, Yordanos gúúr jamatse ash asho Yohans maantsa bowaafo. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Bowere bomorro keewfetst, Yordanos fokotse Yohans kishatsna bogupefo.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref> </char>
    </note> Ernmó Yohans ferisawino eteefwotsnat Seduk'awino eteefwotsitse aywots gupeyosh bíyo bowafere b́bek'tsok'on boosh hank'o bíeti «It dawnzi nana'uwotso! weyiru fayotse it keshetwok'o kone izi itsha? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Eshe naandrone it ettsok'o kitsit fino finore. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoh. 8:33</ref> </char></note> ‹Noo Abraham nana'uwots noone› eto itn b́kishitwok'o itsh ark'aye, Ik'o shútsanotsitse Abrahamsh nana'uwotsi tizosh falitwe etirwe itsha. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mat. 7:19</ref> </char></note> Andmó, shakurtso miti shir jamotse fe'e. Mansh shuwi sheeng shuraw mit jamo k'ut'de'er tawots juwetwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Eshe hamb taa, naandi jangosh aatson iti gupetwe, taayere il wetwonmó S'ayin shayironat tawon itn gupetwe, bíye taayere ayidek't bogfe, taa b́ tufitsi c'aamo dab́ kurosh bodktanaliye. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Bíye b́ kishatse k'orbiyo detsfe, bínowere búts úro sheengshde'er s'ayintsitwe. Sndewonowere t'iwots gaas'etwee, buuyonmó tahraw tawon mitsitwe.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ gupetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk'. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Manoor Iyesus Yohans kishon gupewosh Gelil datsatse tuut Yordanos foko maants b́weyi. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Yohansmó «Han woteratse, taa nkishon gupewo taash b́geyifere, aawk'oneya nee tmaants nweeti?» ett bín baziyo dek'b́twi.<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Iyesusmó «Ik'i shinatse kááw wotts fin jamo hank'on s'eentso noon b́geyitsotse, ando taan bazi k'aye» ett bísh bí aaniy. Yohanswere keewman wotowe ett bín b́gupi. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Iyesus gupeyat aatsotse b́ keshtsok'on manoor daro k'esheeb́wtsi, Ik'i S'ayin shayiro kurkund araat Iyesus ats b́ oot'fere b́ bek'i. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Aze. 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7">Dub. 7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa. 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11">Mar. 11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk'. 9:35</ref> </char></note> Manoor «Hambe, bín t geneúwitwo t shunts na'oni» etiru k'ááro darotse b́weyi.<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi fadetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk'. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:18">Ibr. 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il, Iyesus Diyablosń b́ fadetwok'o Ik'i shayiro worwo maants bín dek'tbíami. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Manoknowere hab aawonat hab t'úwo b́ s'oomiyakon k'ak'b́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Faditwonúwere Iyesus maants waat «Nee arikon Ik'o naayi neena wotiyal, ááb shútsanotsi misho wotoore err azazowe» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Iwi. 8:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesusmó « ‹Asho b́ beet Ik'o nonotse keshet aap' jamona bako mish mec'ronaliye› ett guut'ere» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="NEH 11:1">Neh. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:24">Dan. 9:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il, diyablos Iyesusi S'ayin kitu Iyerusalem maants dek'amt Ik' maa tookats need'idek't, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Dub. 91:11-12</ref> </char></note> « ‹Nee arikon Ik'o naay neena wotiyal n tufwotsi shútso b́towawok'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">Bokishon neen dambaan botep'etwok'o b́ melakiwotsi azazitwe›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">Ett́ guut'etsotse, hanatse dashan ntooko sha'e» bí et.<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Iwi. 6:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere anidekt « ‹Ando n doonz Izar Izeweri fadk'aye› ett guut'ere.» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Aaninwere diyablos Iyesusi ayidek't damb tuuts gurats kishdek't, datsatsi naash jamo bomangonton kitst <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>«Taash gúp'gup'ar n sagadiyal jaman neesh imetwe» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Iwi. 6:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor Iyesus, « ‹N doonz Izar Izewersh sagadowe b́ s'uznowere ik'iwe!› ett guut'etsotse ok tuwwe nee shed'anono!» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Maniyere il diyablos Iyesusi k'azb́k'ri, melakiwotswere waat bísh bofini.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus daniyo galiln dek' b́ tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar. 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk'. 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat. 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar. 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk'. 3:19-20</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus Yohans b́tipewo b́ shishtsok'on Galil datsomand k'azbíami. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Yoh. 2:12</ref> </char></note> Nazret kitu k'azk'rat, Zablonnat Nftalem awrajo Gelil aats k'ari ganoke fa'ú K'frnahom kitots waat b́beeyi.<verse eid="MAT 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Man b́ wotwere, nebiyiyo Isayas hank'o ett b́keewts bek'on aap'etso b́ s'eenetwok'owa b́tesh.<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Aats k'aromaants dek't amiru werindonat Yordanos fokoniyere bak'etse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Daatseyiru Zablon datso, Nftalem datso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ik' ash woteraw Gelilo!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa. 9:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> T'alwotse beyiru asho sháán eeno bek're,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">K'iri c'iisho bíyats b́dihts datsatse beyirwotsshowere shááno keshre.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat. 3:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Manortson b́tuutso Iyesus, «Ik'i mengstu bkarnotsotse naandrone erere!» et fetst nabo dek't b́tuwi.<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus mus'detsf awdetswotsi b́s'egok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk'. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Iyesus Gelil aats k'ari ganoke b́beshefere, mus' detsf eshu gitwots, boowere P'et'rosi eteefo S'imoonnat bí eshu Indriyasn bo mus'kambo aats k'aromaants boshap'fere b́bek'i. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Iyesuswere «Tshuutso shoyde woore, Mus'o it detsirwok'o ashuwotsi taash it kakwitwok'o woshitwe» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Bowere manoor bo mus'i kambo k'azk'rat b́shuutso shoydek't botwi.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Maniyere beshat, Zebdiwos nana'a wotts k'osh eshu gitetswotsi Yak'obnat Yohansn bek'b́k'ri. Bowere bonih Zebdiyosnton jeelbi abaats wotdek't bo mus'ikambo shipoke bobefere boon b́s'eegi. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Bowere manoor bo jelbunat bonihn k'azk'rat b́ shuutso shoydek't boami.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ay ashuwotsi b́ danitsok'onat b́ kashitsok'on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk'. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mat. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar. 1:39</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesus ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse danifetst Ik'i mengsti doo shishi aap'i jango keewfetst, ay naari shodonat atsiweshon deshets ashuwotsi kashifetst Gelil dats jamatsa b́ guurefo. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>B́ shútso Sooriya eteets dats jamatse b́ shishetsotse ash jamo shod naar ayonat, bo kishonat tufoon lasha'atswotsi, shod ayon kic'rwotsi, kim shayiro bogitsotse kindt fa'úwots, dikf shodo detstswotsenat dúr jametswotsnowere b́maants dek't boweyi, bíwere kashi bí'ishi. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Gelil datsonat tats kitwotsitse<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tats kitwotsitse: </char><char style="ft">Giriki noon keewon ayhudi woteraw ashuwots ikokere bo beyiru beyoko tats kitwotsi eteefoni. Kit jamwots bodatseyir Galil aatsi k'aroniyere aaw keshonat gáár weeron aaw kesho maantse. </char></note> Iyerusalemnat Yhudon, Yordanos fokoniyere bak'etse ayi ashuwots Iyesus shuutso shoyidek't bosha'i.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus guri abaatse bedek't b́danits dano</para>
  <para style="ms">(K'ot' 5—7)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Iyesus b́ shuuts shoydek't sha'iru ay asho b́ bek'tsok'on, guri abaats kesht beeb́dek'i, b́ danifwots b́maants t'iinbodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Hank'o et tnwere daniyo dek'b́twi.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Arik wotts deero daatsit ashuwots</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk'. 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Dari mengstu bok b́wottsotse, Ik'ats te'eyirwots</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa. 61:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o boon b́ k'up'shitwotse, shiyanirwots</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:11">Dub. 37:11</ref> </char>
    </note> Sheeng ashuwots datso bo naatetwotse derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1-2">Isa. 55:1-2</ref> </char>
    </note> Kááw keewo k'ak'irwotsnat shashwirwots, boworitwootse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Bosh maac'o k'ewetwosh maac' nefitwots derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:3-4">Dub. 24:3-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Nib s'ayin detstswots Ik'o bobek'etwotse derekno.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Ash ashi dagotse manonat jeenon woshitwots,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">Ik'i nana'uwotsiye eteetwotse derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1 P'et'. 3:14</ref> </char>
    </note> Kááw keewosh gisheyirwots Ik'i mengstu bok bwottsotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">Derekne.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11</char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 P'et'. 4:14</ref> </char>
    </note> «T jangosha err ashaashwots itn boc'ashor bogiishor, kooton it shúútso bot'afiwor derek itne. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Zen. 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:25">Wosh. 7:25</ref> </char></note> Dari mengstotse it daatsit k'awntso een b́wottsotse gene'ore, ayide gene'ore. Itiyere shin teshts nebiyiwotsi mank'o gishewo boats betsrne.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beronat sháánon ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk'. 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk'. 14:34-35</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «It datsatsi beerok'o itne, ernmó beero b́shaawo b́ t'ut'etka wotiyal b́shaawo aak'alrniya aaniy daatso b́faliti? Úromaants juweyar ashon net'eyoniyere okoon shinomaants egoshor woteratse. <verse eid="MAT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref> </char></note> Itiye datsansh sháán itne, guri abaats ageets kitu ááshosh falratsane. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar. 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luk'. 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots c'eesho c'eeshde'er mootse fa'a ash jamwotssh b́sháánitwok'o girgijiyatsa bogedfoni bako oosh shirots dashan geraknee. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1 P'et'. 2:12</ref> </char></note> Mank'o ashuwots it sheeng fino be'ear it nih darotstso bo mangiytwok'o, it sháánonwere ash jami shinatse shááne.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muse weeron imets nemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>Aaninwere Iyesus hank'o bíet, «Muse nemonat nebiyiwots danits dano gakosh twatsok'o itsh bíarerawok'owa, taaye bos'eentwok'o woshoshe t weyi bako gákosh waratse. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luk'. 16:17</ref> </char></note> Ariko itsh keewirwe, daronat datson bobeshefetsosh nem jamo s'eenetwe bako nemotse fidel múk'na'a iku wee k'op'u t'afratsane. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Mansha tzazi múkna'anotsitse dab iku gaketwonat k'osh ashuwotswor bogaketwok'o boon danit asho dari mengstotse múk'ee b́wotitiye. Ernmó t tzazi jamanotsi s'eentsosh, k'oshwotswere bo s'eentsitwok'o boon danit asho dari mengstotse een wotitwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Manshe kááw it woto nem danifwotsenat ferisawino eteefwotskoniyere bogo b́k'azal b́jamon dari mengstots it kindrawok'o itsh keewirwe.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Yoots dúr teshts ashuwotssh eteetso shishrte, manwere ‹úd'k'aye, ash úd'tsats angshetwe› eteeke. <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Taamó itsh keewirwe, bíeshwi fayitw jamats angsha angsheti, ando bí'eshush, ‹Nee woterawani!› err c'ashetwo angshirwots shinatse bíats angsheti, ‹Dartsani› err c'ashetu jamo gahanem tawotsa b́kinditwok'o bíats angsheti. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Eshe nee n wosho gizi wosh t'intseyiru t'arp'ezok Ik'osh n door, niyats iirts eshwo b́ beewo n gawitka wotiyal, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>n wosho gizi wosh t'intsiru tarap'ezmanok gerk'rar, amr shini n eeshunton manewe, maniyere okoon aanar n wosho t'intswe. <verse eid="MAT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>N balngaro neen s'amire angishi moo maants b́ damfere weerindatse káári n balangaronton ik wotowe. Man woto b́k'zal n nbalangaro danyosh, danyonwere polisosh, polisonu beshde'er b́ ime tipi moots n kinditi. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Aroniye neesh ti keewiri, niyats angshets santimi tebu day ni'ishfetsosh b́ jamon manitse keyatsne.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Widi jangosh imets dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kesh. 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Iwi. 5:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Wido amk'aye!» eteetsok'o shishrte. <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Taamó itsh keewirwe, «Máátso s'iilt tewnts jamo, manoor b́ nibotse binton k'eeree» etre. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:19">Mat. 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mar. 9:47</ref> </char></note> N k'ani ááwo morro nfinitwok'o neen b́woshitka wotiyal, kishde juk'rowe! niats jamó gahanemits b́ juwewoniyere níatsatse ikoko nt'ut'o neesh k'anefe. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mat. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar. 9:43</ref> </char></note> N k'ani kisho morro n finitwok'o b́ k'aliyal, k'ut'de juk'rowe, niats jamo gahanemits b́ juwewoniyere niatsotse ikoku n t'ut'o k'anefe neesha.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faksheyi jango imets dano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk'. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Iwi. 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:7">Mat. 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar. 10:4</ref> </char>
    </note> «B́ máátsu fakshitu jamo bin b́fakshtsok'o kitsit frmo bish ímee» etre. <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk'. 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 K'or. 7:10-11</ref> </char></note> Taamó «Widi jangon b́wotiyala bako, b́ máátsu fakshitu jamo widets bwotitwk'owa bin b́woshiti, fakshetsu deke'etu jamonwere widetsiye b́wotiti.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taari jangosh imets dano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lew. 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Taaw. 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Iwi. 23:21</ref> </char>
    </note> Ando shin ashuwotssh, «Kooton taark'ayere, ernmó it taaro doonzosh s'eentswere» eteetsonowere shishrte. <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:12">Yak'. 5:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mat. 23:22</ref> </char></note> Taamó, «B́jamonor taark'ayere» etirwe itsha. Daronwere Ik'i beyoki joor b́wottsotse, daronor b́wotiyal, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Dub. 48:2</ref> </char></note> Datsunwere doonzo tufi need'oko bwottsotse datsonor taark'ayere, nugus eeno kitu bwottsotse Iyerusalemno taark'ayere, <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>N took s'iirotse ikunor dab nas'o wosho wee aak' wosho nfalrawotse ntookonor b́wotiyal taark'aye. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lew. 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Taaw. 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Iwi. 23:21</ref> </char></note> Mansh it noon keew keewon «Ee» it etal «Ee» et wotowa wee «Iya'a» it etal «Iya'a» et wotowa bako maniyere beshtso shed'anikee.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Weer weersho b́ geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk'. 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>« ‹Ááwi shegro ááwa, gáshi shegro gásha› eteetsok'o shishrte. <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Taamó hank'o etirwe itsha, gond itats finiru ashuwotsats weero wersh k'ayere. Ernmó nk'ani malalo jabitwosh ngiri malalo ananshde ime. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Ash iko nkito dek'osh geeyar niyatse b́moshal, n kotiyonor b́dek'etwok'o bísh k'ayk'rowe. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Ash iko ‹Taanton kuro kurde ik kilo metrok'o amee,› err neen b́shefiyal, nemon kuro kurde git kilometro bínton amee. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:42 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 15:8">Iwi. 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:29">Ari. 24:29</ref> </char></note> Niyoke k'onitwosh ime, niyoke gushosh geyirwosh k'aze etk'aye.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">N balangaro shuni jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-36">Luk'. 6:27-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bí'eti, « ‹N giyo shune, n balngaro shid'ee› eteetsok'o shishrte. <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:44 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Ari. 25:21-22</ref> </char></note> Taa it balngarwotsi shunere, iti gishirwotssh Ik'o k'onwere» etirwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Han it k'aliyal, darotse fa'o it nihsh nana'úwotsi wotitute. Bíye gondwotsnat sheengwotssh aawo kishirwee, mank'o kááwwotsnat k'uurwotssh bí awsho butsirwee. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Iti shunir ashuwots s'uzi it shunal eeg k'awntse it detsi? Morretswots<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Morretswots: </char><char style="ft">Eto Griki mas'aafotse t'ilish ko'ifwotsi etfe. </char></note> mank'o k'alirunoshna <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>It eshwots s'uzi jamo it aatitka wotiyal eshe aawne bogo it finirwoni? Ik' ash woterawotswor mank'o k'alirunoshna? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lew. 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18">18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Iwi. 18:13</ref> </char></note> Eshe daritstso it nih s'een b́wottsok'o itwere s'eenwotsi wotoore.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Tewd dowi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat. 23:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Ashuwots taan be'enee err sheeng fino ash shinatse finoniyere it tooko korde'ere, maniyalbakó daritsitso it nihoke eegor k'awntso daatsratste. <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>Eshe t'owwotssh n'ímoor, ash shinatse shunewna etiru git alberetswots Ik' k'oni moonat werind weerindatse bo k'alirwok'o be'ewosh k'alk'ayere, arikon itsh keewirwe, booye shin shino bo k'awntso daatsdek'rnee. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Neemó tewdi doon ni ímoor n k'ani kisho b́ k'alirwo n giri kisho b́danawok'owa. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Eshe n tewdi doo áátson wotowe, ááshon finetso bek'irwo nnih n sheeng fini k'awntso neesh dashetwe.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' k'oni jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk'. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luk'. 18:10-14</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ik'o it k'onor git alberetswotsk'o wot k'ayere! bo asho boosh b́bek'etwok'owa erŕ Ik' k'oni moonat werind weerindatse need'de Ik' k'ona boshunfoni. Ariko itsh keewirwe, bohe bok'awntso shin shino daatsdek'rnee. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Nee Ik'o nk'onormó, n moots kindde nfengesho ic'de'er ááshon beyirwo nnihi k'onwe, ááshon n k'ontso bek'irwo nnihi k'awntso neesh dashetwe.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:25-29">1 Naash. 18:25-29</ref> </char>
    </note> «It Ik'o it k'onor Ik' ash woterawwotskok'o ay ooshiwon keewk'ayere, bo ananshdek' ayoto bo keewtsosh Ik'o bok'ono b́ k'ebetwok'oweya boosh bíariri? <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Itmó it nih itsh geyit keewo bín it k'onfetsere shino b́ dantsotse bokok'o wotk'ayeree. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Eshe it Ik'o it k'onor hank'o err k'onwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‹Darotse beyirwo nonihono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">N shúútso mangwee,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>N mengstu wowiyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">N shuno darotse b́ wottsok'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">Mank'o datsatsno wotowe.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Noosh geyit misho hambets noosh ime.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Noowere noon dádtswotssh oorowe noettsok'o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">Nofints morro noosh orowa eree,<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Gondatse noon kore bako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Fadeyots noon kindshk'aye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">[mengsto, angonat mangon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Dúre dúron nike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">Amen.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft">Mengsto, ango, manga etirwo kishon guut'ets shints mas'afwotsitse hanotsi deshakno. </char></note>›<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Ashuwots morro boosh orowa it etal, itshowere daritstso it nih itsh orowa etetuwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:25-26">Mat. 11:25-26</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots morro oorowe eto it k'azaalmó it morronowere daritstso it nih itsh orowe eraatse.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oomi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:5">Isa. 58:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «It s'oomor, bo s'oomo ashuwots boosh bodanetwok'o, boshiitso wonawoniru git alberetswotsk'o, it shiitso sholik'ayere, arikon itsh keewirwe, booye bok'awntso dek'wtserne. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Neemó n s'oomor n shiitso mashde'e, n tokatsowere fuurde'ee, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Mank'oon, eshe n s'oomo ááshon beyirwo nnihiyere okoon k'osho konwor danatse. Ááshon finetso bek'irwo nnihwere n k'awntso neesh dashetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Datsatse gaalo ko'iyo bgeyirawok'o b́danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk'. 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:2-3">Yak'. 5:2-3</ref> </char>
    </note> Ando aani dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Barariyonat hajoon bot'afitwoke, úmp'etswotswere tishde bo úmpitwoke, datsanatse it tookosh gaalo ko'ik'ayeree. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Maniyere barariyonat hajif keewwots t'afiyo bofalrawoke, ump'etswotswere tishr boúmp'erawok darots it gaalo ko'iwere. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>N gaalo b́beeyirwoke n nibonúwere manoknee b́ daatseti.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash atsatsi c'eesho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk'. 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>«Ááwo atsi c'eeshee, manshe niááwo jeena wotiyal, niats jámó sháán wotitwe, <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ni ááwo jeen wotob́k'azalmó, niats jamo t'alwe b́wotiti. Eshe niatse fa'a shááno t'alu b́wotiyal, t'alwo aawk'owe iki b́ gonditik'uuna!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beyosh shiyano b́ geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk'. 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Ash iko doonz gitosh guuts woto falratse, wee ikoniye b́shit'eti, k'oshonowere b́shuneti, wee ikosh amanek wotitwe, k'oshonowere gac'itwee, mank'o ash iko iknon Ik'onat gizonsh guuts woto falratse. <verse eid="MAT 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>Mansh eshe hank'o itsh etirwe, ‹Eege no meeti? Eege no úsheti? Egek'una no tahiti?› Eton it beyi jangosh shiyank'ayere, mishoniyere kasho, tahoniyere atso bowatsáá? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Aab darotse bidiru kafwotsi s'iilere, bo shohatsnee, k'ec'atsnee, t'iwots gáác'atsnee, ernmó daritstso it nihye boon manziri. Eshe it kafwotsiyere ayidek'at bogftoshnáá? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 39:5-7">Dub. 39:5-7</ref> </char></note> Ititse kic'ar b́beeyi dúrats ik aaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">B́beeyi dúrats ik aaw: </char><char style="ft">Ik ik bitswotsitsere «b́ need'ats ik indú» etirwo daatsetwe. </char></note> dabdek'o falitwo kone bíí? <verse eid="MAT 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>Ando mank'o tahi jangosh eegoshe it kic'iri, shiratsi fundwotsi aawk'o bo eenirwk'o s'iilere, booye finon ayidek't maawratsnee, jokeratsnee, <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Naash. 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Zen. 9:3-6</ref> </char></note> B́mang jamonton Solomonwoŕ dab́ boyitsi ikuk'o taheratse, etirwe itsha. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Eshe hambets be'eyar yats tawots jwetwo shiratsi tootso, Ik'o hank'o b́ takitkawotiyal, it shapts imnetiyetswotso! itnere bogshde'er aawk'oneya tako b́k'azeti? <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Mansh eshe it ‹Eege nomeeti? Wee, eege noúsheti? Egeek'uwa notahiti?› Erfetsr shiyanon kic'k'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Man daatsosho Ik' ash woterawotswor geyirunee, itsh jaman b́geyitwok'o daritstso it nih danfee. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Itmó, shin shino Ik'i mengstonat kááwo gewoore. Oorts keew jamo itsh dabeetwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Yaatso b́tookish kic'itwee, yaatsish kic'k'ayere, aawosh b́gondoo bodfe.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ashaats angsho b́ geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luk'. 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>Manats dabt́ Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «It atsats angsherawok'o konatsor angshk'ayere, <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar. 4:24</ref> </char></note> k'oshwotsats it angshtsok'o it atsowere angshetwe, mank'o it tatsts tatsi k'ac'ots itsho tatsetwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Ni ááwotse fa'a gindo nbe'aawo ni'eshu ááwitsi kiimo n s'iil eegishe? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Eshe niááwotse gindo b́befere, ni'eshuush, ‹Aab ni ááwitsi kimman kishuna› nietet ááwk'oneya? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Nee git albertsono, shin niááwotse fa'a gindo kishwe, maniyere il, nieshu ááwotse fa'a kiimo kishosh shengshde bek'etune. <verse eid="MAT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>Woshosh t'ints meets S'ayino kanwotssh imk'ayere, it ink'wo guritswots shinats juuk'ayere, gúritswots itko b́k'awntso shaaw gizon keewets malo botufon boneed'awok'owa, kanwotswere aanar itn shas'etunee.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kup'de Ik' k'oni oot'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk'. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«K'onwere itsh imetwe, gewoore daatsitute, fengesho k'ofore itsh k'eshetwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>K'onitu jamo dek'etwe, geyirwonúwere daatsitwe, fengesh k'ofitwoshowere k'eshetwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Ititse b́ na'o tusho b́k'onoor shútso imetwo kone? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Mus'o b́k'onre dawnzo imetwá? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Eshe it gondwotsi wotefetsat, it nana'úwotssh sheeng keewo imo it daniyakon, bérée, darotse fa'o it nihi bín k'onitwotssh bogshde aawk'owe sheeng keewo imo b́k'azeti! <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 6:13">Luk'. 6:13</ref> </char></note> Eshe haniyak ashuwots itsh bok'alitwok'o it geyiru jamo itwere boosh mank'o k'alwere, nemonwere, nebiyiwots keewtso danonwere b́ keewirwo haniye.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fengesh t'ebú jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk'. 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Fengesh t'ebún kindúwere, t'afo maants kindshit fengesho gawne, b́ werindonúwere eene. Manmaants kindit ashuwotswere ankatnee. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 21:8">Erm. 21:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 30:19">Iwi. 30:19</ref> </char></note> Kashomaants kindshiru werindonu t'ebee, b́ werindonwere kic'ike, bín daatsit ashuwotswere aynaliye.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mito b́shuwone b́ danifoni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk'. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:27">Hzk'. 22:27</ref> </char>
    </note> «Mereeri gok'o tahde it maants weetwotsatse, bogitsotsnmó biik'ts boditsi Elah wotts kootets nebiyiwotsatse it atso korde'ere, <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Bonowere it danet bo fini shuwonee. Angitsi t'ugi atatse weyini shuwo, koshshlatse belesi miti shuwo mec'eetwa? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Mank'o miti sheeng jamo shuwi sheengo shuwitwee, gond mitonwere gond shuwo shuwitwee. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Miti sheengo gond shuwo shuwosh falratse, gond mitonwere sheeng shuwo shuwosh falratse. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat. 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luk'. 3:9</ref> </char></note> Sheeng shuwo shuraw mit jamo k'ut'de tawo maants juwetwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mat. 12:33</ref> </char></note> Mansh eshe, kootets nebiyiwotsi bofini shuwon boon danetute.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taa iti danatse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk'. 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>« ‹Doonzono! Doonzono!› taash etiru jamo daritsi mengstots kindratse, daritsi mengstots kinditwo darotse fa'o t nih shuntso finitwoniyee. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Angshi aawots ayuwots, ‹Doonzono! Doonzono!! n shútson bek'o keewratsnowa? N shútson fo'erawo kishratsnowa? Nshútson ay adits keewwotsi k'alratsnowa?› Etetune taasha. <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Dub. 6:8</ref> </char></note> Taawere manots aawots, ‹B́ jamon itn danatse! it gond finirwots tiyatse okaan wokoore!› eteetwe boosha.<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'alats wee shiyats ageets moowwotsi ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk'. 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Ti aap'an k'ewde'er finats jitsit jamo b́ moo s'alats agts s'ek ashoni bí ariye <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Awshonú b́butsi, di'onwere b́di'ii, jongonwere jongat maa man b́ gifniy, ernmó, maaman shútsi s'alats bí agetsotse dihratsee. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Ti aap'tsan shisht finats jitsrawonmó b́ moo shiyats agts gik'ets ashoniye bíari. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Awsho b́butsi, di'o b́ di'i, jongo jongat maaman b́gifnii, moonwere manoor dihbwtsi, b́dih dihonwere dihi gondo b́dhi.» <verse eid="MAT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Iyesus keewanotsi keewt b́ ishtsok'on ashuwots b́ danits danatse tuutson bo'adi. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar. 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk'. 4:32</ref> </char></note> Adtswotswere bí bo nem danifwotskok'o b́woterawo aletsok'o b́ daniyrwotsna b́tesh.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus een shodets asho b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk'. 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Iyesus guri abaatse b́ oot'tsok'on ay ashuwots b́ jafrats botuwi. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Manoor een shodets ash iko waat b́ gubrats diht «Doonzono! ni eekiyal taan s'ayitso falitune» bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Iyesuswere b́ kisho jargdek't bín shú'at «Eekitwee, s'ayine!» bí eti. Een shodetsmanwere manoor bí een shodmanatsee s'ayin b́wútsi. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew. 14:1-32</ref> </char></note> Maniyere il Iyesus, een shodotse kashtsmansh hank'owa bíet, «Keewan konshor keewk'aye, ernmó nkashtsok'o amr kahniwotssh kitswe, boats gaw b́wotiisha, n kashtsotse Muse b́ azazts wosho Ik'osh t'intswe» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus bali naasho guutso b́ kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk'. 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>K'frnahom kitotse Iyesus b́ kindtsok'on, Rom datstso balatsi naasho b́ maants t'int k'onfetst, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>«Doonzono, t guutso durutsat ayidek't kic'efetstniye b́ k'eyiri» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Iyesuswere «Taa waar bín kashiytwee» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Balatse naash wottsonmó hank'o ett bísh bíaaniy, «Doonozono! nee tmoots nikindosh bodk ash taanaliye, b́wotefermó ik aap'u s'uzi keewwe bako, t guutso kashitwe. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Taahe t tookon altswotssh alek wotefetsat, t shirotse tíaaliru kes' kes'fwotsi detsfe, boyitsi ikosh ‹Amee!› ti etor ametuwe, k'oshonwere ‹Wowe› ti etor weetwe, t guutsonwere ‹Han k'alwe› ti etor k'alitwe» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Han b́ shishtsok'on Iyesus bí adi, b́ shuuts shoydek't sha'iru ashuwotssh hank'o bíeti, «Arikon itsh keewirwe hankok'o bodts een imnetiyo detsts ik ashonor Isra'elitse daatsratse. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Ayuwots aaw keshonat aaw kindon weetúnee, Abrahamnton, Yisehak'nton, Yak'obnton dari mengsti mishi maratse beedek'etúne etirwe itsha. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:12">Isa. 49:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:11">Mil. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:3">Dub. 103:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mat. 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk'. 13:28</ref> </char></note> Mengstaani naatosh boon b́ geyirwotsmó úratse fa'a t'alwotse bojweti. Manoknowere eeponat gash k'aashon wotitwe.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Maniyere il bali abaatsi naashmansh Iyesus «Amee! ni amantsok'o neesh wotowe» bí et. Guutsonwere manoori sa'aton kashb́wtsi.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shodets aywotsi b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk'. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Maniyere il Iyesus P'et'ros moots b́ kindtsok'owon P'et'ros awu bi'atso k'ees't bíere shodat b́ k'eyirwok'o b́bek'i. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>B kisho b́ shuu'útsok'on manoor biatsi k'ees'o bín faksh b́k'rere kashbwts, tuwatnwere Iyesussh b́fiini. <verse eid="MAT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Datsonwere b́ iltsok'on ashuwots Fo'erawwotsn detsets ay shodetswotsi Iyesusmaants dek't boweyi, bíwere b́ nooni aap'on kim shayirwotsi b́ kishi shodets jamwotsnowere b́ kashiyi. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa. 53:4</ref> </char></note> Man b́k'altsatse tuutson nebiyiyo Isayasn, «Bíhe no kúúno k'aa'úb́dek'i, no shodono kurb́dek'i» bek'on eteetso b́s'eeni.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jafrats sha'irwotsats bodet gond bek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk'. 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Ash ayo bín gúrdekt bobefere bek't Iyesus b́ danifwtssh bak'ets bokimetwok'o b́azazi. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Maniyere hakon nem danifo Iyesusok waat, «Danifono! ni'ametu jamok nshuutso sha'ona» bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Iyesuswere, «Waangwots gop'o detsfne, daaratse bidíru kafwots kúto detsfne, ashna'onmó bíts kash b́dek'et beyoko deshatse» ett bíaaniy. <verse eid="MAT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>B́ danifwotsitse iko «Doonzono! shino amr tnihi duuhr<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Duuhr: </char><char style="ft">B́nihi b́ k'irfetso woc'r dukosh b́ detsts shuno kitsirwoniye b́ ari. </char></note> twetwok'o taash eekowe» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Iyesuswere «Neehe tshuutso shoy de'er wowe, k'irtswotsiye boko k'irtso duh bodek'etwok'o boon k'ay k'rore» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kup'ts jongo s'ik b́'etetwok'o b́ k'altsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar. 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk'. 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Iyesus jelbots b́kidre, b́danifwots b́jafrats botwi. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Eegurahi eeno aats k'aratse b́tuutsatse jongi eenman jelbu k'oot'osh bí eti, Iyesusmó manoor k'eya b́k'eyir. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>B́ daniyfwots Iyesusok t'int «Doonzono! Aage t'afrone, noon fariwe!» ett bín tokrotse bo tuuzi.<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Bíwere «It imnetiyo itsh shaptswotso! eegoshe it shatiri?» bí et. Manyakowere Iyesus tuut jongonat aats k'aaron bíhadi, een s'ik etonu wotb́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Ash ashuwotswere adt, «Jongonat aats k'arwots bísh boaleyiruhan aawk'o ashe?» bo et. <verse eid="MAT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Iyesus Gelil dats aats k'aroniye kimt, Gergesenon datsats b́ waatsok'on Fo'erawo boon b́detsts ash gitwots doowi beyoke kesht bínton gonke bowtsi, ayidek't shatiik boteshtsotse asho konwor man weeron besho falraka b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JDG 11:12">Mes. 11:12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:10">2 Sam. 16:10</ref> </char></note> Bowere «Nee, Ik'o naayo! nee nooke eeg kis'e ndetsi? Aawalo noon kic'iyosheya nweyi?» Etfetst bokuhi. <verse eid="MAT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Boyere muk'i okááne wokat fa'a beyoke gurits s'eeno b́ jinfera b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Fo'erawonwere, «Noon nkishitka wotiyal, oona neesha gurits s'een manmaats noon damiwee» ett bín bok'oni. <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Iyesuswere «Ameree!» bí eti. Mann ashuwotsitse kesht guritswotsits amt bokindi. Gurits jamwotswere gohi gúúratse tengsheyat oot't aats k'arots k'oot'eyt bok'iri. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Guritswotsi jinirwotswere giifat kitots kindt jam keewo bokeewi, Fo'eraw boon detsts ashuwotsats wotts keewono bokeewi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Maniyere il kit manitsi ash jamó Iyesusi bek'osh boweyi, bín bobek'tsok'on bodatsatse keer bíametwok'o bok'oni.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ash duro b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk'. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Maniyere il Iyesus jelbots kinddek't aats k'arotse kimt b́took kitumand b́weyi. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Manoknowere ashuwots es'ats k'eyiru bíatso lasha'ats ash iko b́maand dek't boweyi. Bíwere bo aman amano bek't, bíatso lashatsosh, «T naayo! kup'owe shenono, n morr jamo neesh orowa eteere» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Manoor nemo danifwotsitse ik ikwots, «Ashaahan Ik'oniye b́ c'ashiri!» ett bonibotse bo gawi. <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Iyesuswere bo gawirwo dank'rat hank'o boosh bíeti, «It nibots eegoshe gond keewo itgawiri? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>B́wotiyaloru n morro oorowe eteere etonat tuur amee! etotse aaw ketfa? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Ernmó ash na'o datsatse morro k'a'úbazosh alo b́ detstsok'o it danisha» ett biatso lasha'atsosh «Tuur ni'es'o kurde nmoo maants amee» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Ashonwere tuut b́moo maants k'az bíami. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Ashuwotswere man bobek'tsok'on bo shati, hank'o bodtso alo ashosh b́ imtsotse Ik'o bo udi.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Matiwosi eteetso Lewiyi b́ s'eegtsok'owo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk'. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Iyesus manoke tuut amoke b́befere Matiwosi eteefo t'ilish dek'eef beyoke b́befere bek't «T shuutso wowe» bíet. Bíwere tuut b́ shuutso b́ ami. <verse eid="MAT 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Maniyere il Iyesus Matiwos mootse mishimaratse b́befere t'ilish ko'if aywotsnat morretswotsn man maants waat bínat b́ danifwotsnton mishimaratse beebodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk'. 15:1-2</ref> </char></note> Ferisawino eteefwotswere man bek't «It danifo eegoshe t'ilish ko'ifwotsnat morretswotsnton towat b́meyiri?» bo et. <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Iyesuswere man shisht hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Shoodetswotssha bako jeenwotssh atetso geyiratse. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mat. 12:7</ref> </char></note> Ameree ‹Taa t geyirwo mhretiya bako woshaliye› ett guut'etso eeg b́wottsok'o p'ec'ar t'iwintsde'ere. Taa twaa kááwwotssh b́woterawo morretswotssh orowe eto bodaatsitwok'o boon s'eegoshe» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'oomi jangosh t'intsets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk'. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Manoor, Yohans danifwots Iyesusok waat «Noonat ferisawino eteyirwotsn jam aawo s'oomere nos'omiri, n danifwotsmo eegoshe s'oomo bok'azi?» ett bín boaati. <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Guuyo bonton b́befere guuy deentswots shiyano boon geyifá? Ernmó guuyo booke b́dek'eet aawo weetwe, manoor s'oomitunee. <verse eid="MAT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>Natts tahats bút'i handro shipetwo konwor aaliye, b́shipalmó bút'i handrman tahi dorman kushide'er b́ gaad'o iki gawintsitwee. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Mank'o aats arwi natots weyini biri handro gáás'etwo konwor aaliye, man k'aleyalmó, aruman t'uu'niye b́wutsiti, weyini bírmanmó kuud'itwee, arwonwere awaashar finats jinaniyere b́ ooriti. Ernmó handr weyini bíro handr arwots gáás'o geyife, mank'oon gitetswots jeenon beetúne.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iya'iros na'únat Iyesus taho t'awits máátsu jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar. 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk'. 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Iyesus man boosh keewoke b́befere, naash iko b́ maants waat, b́ baronowere Iyesus shinats gup'gup'at́, «Hamb t na'ú k'irwtseranee, ernmó nee waar n kisho bíats ngedal kashitwanee» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Iyesuswere tuut ashman shuutso shoydek't bí ami. B́danifwotswere b́shuutso shoydek't boami.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Taaw. 15:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:12">Iwi. 22:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoke, tatse git nat s'eenosh b s'atso kud'at need'o b́k'aye kic'iru mááts iku fa'a bteshi, manoor Iyesus shutsatse b́ tahi jilo bkishon b dets. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Man bk'alwere «B́taho s'uzi dab t t'awiyal kashitwe» etaat b nibotse gawat bteshtsotsna. <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Iyesuswere wongr et aanat bin b́ s'iiliyakon «Kup'owe t ni'e! n imnetiyo neen kashire» bíet. Máátsnwere manoor kash bgutsi.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Maniyere il Iyesus naasho mook b́bodtsok'on shiyani gaato fugfwotsnat hakebak jod'efetst eepiru ashuwotsi b́bek'i. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Bíwere «It únets hanoke ameree! na'ú tokra btokriri bako k'irratsane!» bíet. Boomó b́keewo aatsnit bí'ats bomiis'. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Ashuwots bokeshihakon, Iyesus na'ú bbeyiru maa kayots kindt b kisho b́dets, biwere btuwi. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Keewman een b́wottsok'o gúúrmanatse shishe b́wutsi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aaw dog gituwotsi b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Manoke tuut bíamfere Iyesusi shoydek't aaw dog gitwots bo tuu, boowere «Dawit naayo! oona neesha noosh maac'o k'ewowe!» et fetst bokuhefere botesh. <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Moots b́ kindtsok'on Iyesusok t'iin bodek'i, bíwere «Taa man k'alo tfalitwok'o amaniruteya?» bíet. Bowere «Ee, doonzono!» ett boaaniy. <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Maniyere il Iyesus bo ááwwotsi b́ kishon b́ shuu'ihakon, «It amantsok'o itsh wotowe!» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Bo ááwonwere k'eshe b́wutsi, Iyesuswere «Keewan konshor keewk'ayere!» ett kup'idek't boosh b́ keewi. <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Boomó amt́ gúúrmanatse Iyesus shúútsi eeni jango bokeewi.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ noon duts ash iko b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Bo ááw k'eshets ashuwots kesht boamtsok'on ash k'oshwots Fo'erawo bíatsotse s'eentso ash gidik' iko Iyesus maants dek't bowaa. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Fo'erawonwere b́ gitsotse b́ keshtsok'on ash gidik'o noonkeewo dek't b́tuwi, ash ashonwere «Isra'elitse hank'o keewo b́ jamon be'e danake!» ett bo adi. <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat. 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar. 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk'. 11:15</ref> </char></note> Ferisawino eteefwotsmó «Bíyere Fo'erawo b́ kishir Fo'erawwots naashonee» bo et.<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash ashosh Iyesus maac' b́k'ewtsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat. 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar. 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luk'. 4:44</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere bo Ayhudi Ik' k'oni mootse danifetst, Ik'i mengsti doo shishiyo nabfetst, ashuwotsi shodonat atswesh jamotse kashifetst, kitonat gal jamotse bíananefoni. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Taaw. 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Naash. 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Zen. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hzk'. 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar. 6:34</ref> </char></note> Ash ashonmó jints deshaw mereerwotskok'o kic'efetst dáándat bobefere b́bek'tsok'on boosh maac'o b́k'ewi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Mansh b́danifwotssh hank'o bíet «Mááyo kakwetwo aye, mááy katsman kakwitwotsmó aynaliye. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk'. 10:2</ref> </char></note> Eshe fintswotsi mááy kakwok b́ woshitwok'o mááyi katso doonzi k'onwere.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Tatse git wosheetsots jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk'. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Iyesus tatse git b́ danifwotsi bíyok s'eegdek't, kim shayiro bokishitwok'o, shodonat kúúni shod jamon bokashitwok'o alo boosh b́ ími. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Tatse git wosheetsots shútsonwere hank'oyi, shin shinon P'et'rosi eteetso Sim'onnat bí eshu Indriyasi, Zebdiwos nana'uwots Yak'obnat Yohansn, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filip'os, Bert'elemiyos, Tomasi, t'ilish dek'fo Matiwosi, Ilfyos naay Yak'ob, Tadiwos <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Okooretso Sim'oni, Iyesusi beshidek't imtso Keriyot asho Yihudi.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wosheets tatsegitwotsi daniyosh bo woshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk'. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Iyesus tatse gitwotsi, hank'o ett boon b́woshi, «Ik' ash woterawwotsok amk'ayere, Semari dats ashuwots kitotso kindk'ayere, <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Maniyere mereerikok'o t'afts Isra'el ashuwotsok ameree. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luk'. 10:4-12</ref> </char></note> Amrnwere ‹Dari mengstuuniye karnraniyee!› err nabúwere. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Shodetswotsi kashiwere, k'irtswotsi tuuzwere, een shodetswotsi s'ayintsworee, Fo'erawwotsi kishwere, beenon it dek'tso beenon imere. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Awntso wee ambaro wee k'áázo it borsots deshdek'k'ayre. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 K'or. 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 T'im. 5:18</ref> </char></note> Fintsosh b́ misho daatso bísh b́ geyitsotse it weerindatse k'arc'ito, git kito, gitl c'amono, gumbonowere de'amk'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>Bíts itkindts kitotse, wee gálútse, itn dek'et asho koni b́woto t'iwintsde dande'ere, manokman fakshr it keshfetsosh bíyoke teyere. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Ash moots it kindor jamo aatwere, <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Maa man it jeenosh b́wotititka wotiyal jeeno itoktso bísh boree, wotitkali wotiyalmó itoktso jeeno itsh aanowe. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Wosh. 13:51</ref> </char></note> Asho konwor itide'awo wee it aap'tso k'ebo b́ k'azetka wotiyal gal man wee kit man k'ay it keshor it tufatsi k'undo teboree. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mat. 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aze. 19:24-28</ref> </char></note> Arikoniye itsh t keewiri, angshi aawots kit maniyere Sedomnat Gemor ashuwotsi fayet fayo ketefee.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo b́ wááftsere shino gishewonat gondbek'on b́wotitwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk'. 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luk'. 10:3</ref> </char>
    </note> «Hambe! mereerikok'o elahi taalotse iti twoshiri, mansh dawnzikok'o s'ekwotsi, erkndikok'o dingatwotsi wotoore. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mar. 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:11-12">Luk'. 11:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref> </char></note> Ashuwots angshosh jebats beshide itn imetune, ayhudiyots Ik' k'oni mootse iti jot'etune mansh ashuwotsatse itatso korde'ere. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>T jangosh itn dats k'eezirwtsonat, naashwotsoko it aats angshetwok'o itin de'ameyor bonat Ik' ash woterawwots shinatse t jangosh gawitwotsi wotitute, <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Mooshi jebats itn bot'intsor, it keewitwo manoori sa'atmann itsh imetwotse, ‹Aawuk'o k'alrniya, egek'una nokewiti?› err shiyanon kic'k'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luk'. 21:16</ref> </char></note> It gitsotse bede keewitwo it nih daritstso shayironi bako itnaliye. <verse eid="MAT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>Asho b́took eshwo k'irosh beshide imetwe, mank'o nihonúwere b́ took na'o k'irosh beshide imetwe, na'naonwere bo indnihwotsats balngar wotar tuwitúne, k'iroshowere boon beshide imetune. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Mat. 24:9</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luk'. 21:17</ref> </char></note> T jangatse ash jamoke shit'eek wotitute, ernmó b́s'uwats b́borfetso kup'de'er ned'itwo kashitwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Kit ikutse gondbek'o itats bo ayiwor kit k'oshuts k'ay woc'ere, arikon itsh etirwe, ash na'o aanar b́waafetsosh Isra'el kit jametswotsi gúrar betsatste. <verse eid="MAT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk'. 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoh. 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref> </char></note> Danirwo bín danifoniyere bowatse, guutsonwere b́ doonziyere bowatse. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat. 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:2">Mar. 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luk'. 11:15</ref> </char></note> Mansh danirwo bín danifokok'o, guutsonwere b́ doonzkok'o b́ bodal bísh bodfe. Moo doonzi ‹Beel Zebuliye› err bos'egiyakon b́ maa ashuwotsnmá maniyere bog gond shútson aawk'owe s'eego bok'azeti!<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shato b́ geyitwo koni b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:4-7">Luk'. 12:4-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar. 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk'. 8:17</ref> </char>
    </note> «Haniyak ashuwotsi shatk'ayere, ipetso b́ be'erawo ooritwo, ááshtsonwere b́daneraniye ooritwo eegor aaliye. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Eshe taa t'alwotse itsh tkeewirwo, it sháánatse keewwere, shashikon it shishtso dambaan tuuts beyok waaŕ sháánatse daniwere. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Meets úd'oniyere beshar kash úd'o falraw ashuwotsi shatk'ayere, maniyere kashonat meetson gahanem tawots juwo falitu Ik'o sharere. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Dimbiti gitwots santim múk'wotsn kemefoshná? Wotowa eree, daritstso it nih bí eekerawon, dimbiti ikú datsatse fed'arr ooreratsanee. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>It konmo dab it took s'ironwor taawekee. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Eshe it dimbiti aywotsiyere bogts k'awntsetswotsi itwottsotse b́ jamon shatk'ayere.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«Ash shinatse tjangosh gaw wotitu jametswotssh, taawere darotse fa'o tnih shinatse bísh gaw wotitwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">2 T'im. 2:12</ref> </char></note> Ash shinatse taan haalitu jamwotsi taawere darotstso tnih shinatse haalitwee.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>«Taa twaa, jeeno datsats doosh ark'aye itsha, taa kes'a bako jeeno dek'waratsee. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Taa twaa, nungush na'o b́ nihats, mááts na'ú bi indats, naayo máátsu bi awats, k'alewo tuzishee. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik. 7:6</ref> </char></note> Mansh ashosh balangarwots b́ took maa ashuwotsiye bowotiti. <verse eid="MAT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>Taayere bogo b́ indi wee b́nihi shunetwo, tik wotosh falratse, taayere bogo b́ nungush na'onat b́ máátsna'ú shunetwo tik woto falratse. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mat. 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk'. 9:23</ref> </char></note> B́ took mask'aliyo kurde tshuutso sha'erawo asho tik woto falratse. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Mat. 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar. 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk'. 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref> </char></note> B́ kashu kashiyosh geyiru jamo bin t'afitwe, b́ kashu t jangosh t'afitu jamonmó bin kashitwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar. 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk'. 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoh. 13:20</ref> </char></note> Itn dek'etwo taan deketwe, taano dek'etwo taan woshtso Aabi dek'etwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Nebiyiyo nebiyi shútson dek'etwo nebiyi k'awntso daatsitwe, kááwo kááwi shútson dek'etwo kááwi k'awntso daatsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Arikoniye itsh tietiri, t danif b́wottsatse tuutson, múk'anotsitse ikosh aats ak'o ik brc'k'o dab imetu asho b́ k'awntso t'ud'atsee.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohansoke Iyesusmaants woshetswotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk'. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Iyesus tzazihanotsi b́ danif tatse gitwotssh b́ imihakon manoki beyok man k'azk'rat bíyok karnts kitwotsitse nabonat daniyosh bíami.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Gupfo Yohans tipi mootse b́ befere, Krstos fino b́shishtsotse b́ danif k'atswotsi woshat, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>«Weetwe eteetso neenemó? K'osho koronó?» err Iyesusi bo aatitwok'o b́woshi. <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Amr it bek'tsonat it shishts jamo Yohanssh keewwere. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Isa. 35:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref> </char></note> Hambe! dogwots bek'irunee, shokltswots káwdek't sha'irune, een shodetswots s'ayinirune, waazdoogwots shishirune, k'irtswots tuwirune, t'owwtssh doo shishiyo nabeyirwee, <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>T jangosh t'arat'arerawo deereke.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Yohans woshtswots bo amiyakon, Iyesus Yohans jango hank'o ett ashuwotssh keewo dek't b́tuu, «Aab eeg s'iiloshe woorwomants keshat it weyi? Jongi giwshirw elto s'iilisheya? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Andoor eeg bek'ishe kesh itweyi? Sheeng tah tahdek'ts asho s'iilisheya? Sheeng tah tahtswotsiyere naash naashi mootsne bo fa'oni. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Eshe, eegoshe it keshi? Nebiyo bek'isheya? Ee, dab nebiyiwoniyere ayidek't bogo bek'ishe etirwe itsha. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil. 3:1</ref> </char></note> Bíye ‹Hambe, n shin shinatse sha'arr, n weerindo k'anitwo t woshtso n shinats woshitwe› ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Arikon itsh etirwe, máátswots boshuuts ashotse gupfo Yohansiyere bogo tuuratse, ernmó dari mengstotse ayidek't muk'efo bíyere bogfe. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Gupfo Yohans dúúrtson tuut hambetsish b́borfetso dari mengstu ayidek'atniye biingifniyeyiri, kup'shde maak'oritwotsmó bin daatsitune.<verse eid="MAT 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luk'. 16:16</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nebiyi jamwots boimts danonat Muse kishatse imets nemo gupfo Yohansok b́borfetso bek'on keewrnee. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:10-13">Mat. 17:10-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11-13">Mar. 9:11-13</ref> </char></note> Eshe bo bokeewtso dek'osh ekitute wotiyal, weetwe eteetso Eliyas hambe, bíhe Yohansiye. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>K'ebet waaz detstso k'ewe!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Ernmó dúranatsi ashuwotsi egontoniya arede t s'ileti k'úúna? Shiratse bedek't botohwotsi s'eegfetst, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‹Turaro itsh fugronee duuwatste! no jawernowere epo k'azrtee!› etiru nana'úwotsiye boariyee. <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Mank'o gupfo Yohans b́woor mááyo b́marwonat woyini bíro b́úyawo b́waare, ‹Hanwo Fo'erawoniye bíatsotse fa'oni!› bísh boeti. <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Ash na'o ando mafetst, úshfetst b́waare, ‹Hanwo! jaaletsonat weyini ushkee, t'ilsh ko'ifuuwotsnat morretswots kod'i ashe!› boeti. Wotowa bako dani telefu arik bwoto b́danet b finone.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aman bok'aztsatse tuutson aatsniyets kitwotsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk'. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Manats dabt Iyesus k'osh kitwotsiyere bogo ay adits keewwotsi b́ fints kitwots, naandrone boerawotse hank'o ett wok'aso dek't b́tuwi, <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa. 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hzk'. 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Iyu. 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-14">Amo. 1:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zek. 9:2-4</ref> </char></note> «Indowe neesha Korazine! Indowe neesha Betesayide! ititse k'aleets aditswots, T'irositsnat Sidon kitwotsitse k'alere wotink'ere manoke beyat teshts ashuwots shiyani taho tahde'er tulo boats buh de'er yoots naandrone etank'ne b́teshi! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Mansh eshe angshi aawots, itiyere T'irosnat Sidonitse teshtswotsko fayo ketitwe etirwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa. 14:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Aze. 19:24-28</ref> </char></note> Neewere K'frnahome!, darots n borfetso dambaan tuwo geefiya? Si'olits oot'etune! n gitsotse k'aleets aditsanotsi, Sidonitse k'alere wotink'ere kitman b t'afrawon hambetsish beyank'aniye bteshi! <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat. 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luk'. 10:12</ref> </char></note> Ari keewhanatse tuutsone neesh tkeewiri, angshi aawots Sedomi fayet fayo neen fayetwoniyere ketefee!»<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosn kashdek'o datsetuwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk'. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Manoor Iyesus hank'owa bíet «Daronat datsonsh doonzo nihono! keewan dantswotsnat t'iwintsitwotssh aatsat danawwotssh n kitstsotse neen udere, <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ee! nihono! han k'alo n shuno wotere. <verse eid="MAT 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh. 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:5">10:5</ref> </char></note> Tnih jamkeewo taash imre, nihoniyere okoon naayo dantso konwor aaliye. Mank'o naayo niyere okoon niho dantso konwor aaliye, naayo b́kitsiyalabako konúwor niho dano falratse.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«It angifinon maawtswotso! kuronweree itats b́mangts jamwots t maants woore! taawere kashdek'o itsh imetwe. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Erm. 6:16</ref> </char></note> T k'ambariyo itats kurde'eree, tiatsnowere s'iilr dande'ere, taa dingatonat ttooko dashan detsk taane, it kashush kashdek'o daatsitute. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>T k'ambaryonúwere kic'iratse, t kuronweree ketee.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Sanbati jango aatetsk'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk'. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Iyesus manoori sanbati aawon sndeyi taari taalotsna b́beshefere b́tesh, b́ danifwots k'ak'wtsat boteshtsotse sndeyi motso k'ut'dek't moo dek't botuwi. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Ferisawino eteefwots man bek't Iyesussh, «S'iile! n danifwots sanbati aawon k'alk'ayere eteetso bo k'aliri!» boeti. <verse eid="MAT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3-4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam. 21:1-6</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíet, «Dawitnat bínton teshts ashuwots k'ak'at boteshor Dawit b́ k'altso b́jamon nababeratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew. 24:9</ref> </char></note> Bí Ik'o moots kindt kahniwotsiyere okoon bín wotowa bínton teshtswotsi wotowa bomarawok'o nemon baziyetso, S'ayin tusho b́meyi. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Taaw. 28:9-10</ref> </char></note> Ando kahniwots sanbati aawon Ik' mootse finefetsr sanbati niwo bokimshor naand wotar boats b́tawerawok'o Muse weeron imetso nemotse guut'etso nababeratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>S'uznmó Ik' mooniyere bogo hambe! hanoke b́fa'oni etirwe itsha. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mat. 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos. 6:6</ref> </char></note> Ando aani ‹Taa t geyirwo mhretiya bako woshaliyee› etiru mas'aafi keewirwo eeg b́ wottsok'o it t'iwintsink'ere morro deshaw ashuwotsats angshrawnk'tee b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Ash na'o dab sanbatoshor doonze.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kish dúr asho kashire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar. 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk'. 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Beyok manoke tuut Iyesus ayhudi Ik' k'oni moots b́ kindi, <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Manoknowere b́kish iko lasha'ats ash iko fa'e b́tesh, Iyesusi bín bodetset keewo geyiru ik ik ashuwots, «Sanbati aawots shodtswotsi kashiyo nemotse fa'a?» eton bo'aati. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luk'. 14:5</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere hank'o boosh bíet, «Ititse mereer iko detstso, b́ mereero sanbati aawots gop'ots b́shirotse b́fed'iyal geetsde kishrawo kone? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Eshe, asho mereeroniyere aawk'owe bog k'awntsetsi woto b́k'azeti! Manshe sanbati aawon sheeng keewo fino baziyekaliye.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́kish lasha'ats ashosh, «N kisho jargwe» bí'et. Bíwere b́ jargree b́kisho kashwtsat ari b́ kish jeenok'o wotb́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Ferisawino eteefwotsmó, manoke kesht Iyesusi aawk'o k'alde'er boúd'itwok'o shiyeyo dek'botuwi.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Ik'o b́fiinosh Galbdek'etsoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Iyesusmó bo t'awi gondo dank'rat beyokmanoke k'azb́tuwi, ay ashuwotswere b́ shuutso shoydek't boami, shodts jamwotsnowere b́ kashiyi. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Ash ashuwotsshmó b́ jango konshor bokeewrawok'o kup'sh dek't bíazazi, <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Han b́wotwere nebiywo Isayasn bek'on keewetso b́s'eenishe.<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>«Hambe! galtdek'tso tguutsoni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Bíye taa tshnfonat bín tgeneeúwitwoniyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">T shayiro bíats beezitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Bíwere kááwts angsho ashuwotssh kuh keewitwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Bí mooyatsee, wee kúheratse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">Weer weeratsnowere b́ k'ááro shishetwo aaliye,<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Bí k'is'ets eltono dab tishatsee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">S'úwiru gagi c'eeshonor takratsee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">Man b́k'alirwere kááwts angsho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">da'a b́dek'fetsoshe.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Ik' ashwotera ashuwots bín jangitúne.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusnat B́eelzebuln</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar. 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk'. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Maniyere il shed'ano bín s'eents ash iko ááwu dogonat gidik'o Iyesusok dek't boweyi, bíwere bín b́kashi, ashmanwere bek'onat noon keewon b́ fali. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Ash jamo adt, «Han Dawit naayi wotifa k'úúna?» boeti.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref> </char>
    </note> Ferisawino eteefwotsmó man boshishtsok'on «bí ‹Beel Zebuli› eteets Shed'ani naashona bako Sheed'no kishratsee» boeti.<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Ieyesuswere bo asaabiyo dank'rat boosh hank'o bíet «Ik mengesto kayeyarr bí atsatsewo b́gawetka wotiyal mengst man dihe b́dihiti. Mank'o kit iko wee ik maa asho bíatsatsewo b́ k'aleyal kup'arr beyo falratse. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Shed'anonwere Shed'ano b́kishitka wotiyal bíatsatsewo k'alere etee, eshe, b́ mengsto aawk'oneya kup'arr beyo b́faliti! <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Eshe, taa fo'erawotsi t kishir Beelzebulna wotiyal, it nanaonmó eegoneya bokishiri? Manshe it nana'uwots itats angshitune. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Taa fo'erawo tkishir Ik'i shayrona wotiyal eshe Ik'i mengstu itmaants waarane etee. <verse eid="MAT 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>Ando ash iko shino kúp'o b́tifawo kúp'man moots kindr b́ detstso biik'o aawk'o k'alrniya b́faliti. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Taanton woteraw jamó taank'eefitkee, taanton kakurawo bad'iye b́bad'iri. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Mansh asho aawnari morro b́finitwosh wee c'ash jamosh oorowe eto daatsitwe etirwe itsha, S'ayin shayiro c'ashetu jamoshmó b́ morro bísh oorowe eteeratse. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk'. 12:10</ref> </char></note> Ash na'o c'ashetu jamo b́ morro bísh oorowe eto daatsitwe. S'ayin shayiro c'ashetu jamonmó datsanatse wotowa weet datsatse b́ morro bísh oorowe eteeratse.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miti sheengo b́ shuwon b́ danfok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk'. 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:20">Mat. 7:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:44">Luk'. 6:44</ref> </char>
    </note> «Mit jamo b́ shuwon b́ danefotse miti sheengo detso itsh geyife, b́ shuwonwere sheeng wotitwe, mito gond b́wotiyalmó b́ shuwonwere gonde b́wotefoni. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk'. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">6:45</ref> </char></note> It dawnzi nana'otso! gondwotsi wotefetsat sheeng keewo keewosh awuk'o k'alrniya it faliti? Asho b́ nonotse b́ keewirwo b́ nibotse s'eent oortsoniye.<verse eid="MAT 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>«Ash sheengo b́ nibi sheengotse s'eents sheeng keewo kishitwe, gond ashonwere b́ nibi gondotse s'eents gond keewo kishitwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Ariko itsh keewirwe, ashuwots kaashk'on bokeewiru aap' ik ikosh angshi aawots boon aatetwee. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Ni aap'tsatse tuutson neesh angshetwe, n aap'ts aap'atse tuutson ni'ats angshetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adits keewo bek'osh aatetsok'owo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk'. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mat. 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar. 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk'. 11:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor nem danif ik ikwotsnat ferisawino etefwotsn Iyesussh, «Danifono! adits milikito n finere bek'osh geefone!» bo et. <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mat. 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar. 8:12</ref> </char></note> Wotowa bako hank'o ettni boosh bíaaniy «Gondonat amaneraw s'oot'o adits milikito bek'o geefe, wotowa eree nebiyiwo Yonas dúri adits milikitoniyere okoon k'osho adits milikito imeratse. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Yonas mus'i eeno maac'otse keez aawonat keez t'úwon b́ beshiyitsok'o, mank'o ash na'o dowootse keez aawonat keez t'úwon beshiyitwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Nenewe kitutsi ashuwots angshi aawots and dúranatse s'oot'anotsnton tuur bíyats angshitunee, Nenewe ashuwots Yonas nabtso bo shishor bo morrosh goynat naandrone etrne. Andmó Yonasiyere bogo hanoke fa'e. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Naash. 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Zen. 9:1-12</ref> </char></note> Múúrtsu naashú Solomon dani teleefo k'ebosh dats daaratse b́watsotse angshi aawots andi dúri s'oot'anotsnton tuur bo atsats angshitwaniyee, andmó Solomoniyere bogo hanoke fa'ee.»<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kim shayirao ashots aanarr b́kinditwok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk'. 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>Haniye il Iyesus hank'owa bí'et, «Kim shayiro ash atsotse b́keshor kash b́dek'etwoko geyaarr aats aaloke shuuk' beyok b́gúúriti. Wotowa eré daatsratse, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Mansh ‹T keshts moots aanarr amna› bíetet. Aanarr b́woorowere, b́ maaman baash wotaarr, s'ayinr, k'anwtsarr b́befere daatsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Maniye okoon, kim shayiro amr bíyere gondts k'osh shawat Fo'erawwotsi de'er b́weti. Bowere shin Fo'erawman maa teshts asho atsotse kindde'e towaar bítse bobeti. Mansh ashman beyo baltsoniyere iltso iki gonde b́woiti. Gond dúranatsi s'oot'anotsats bodetuwonwere han arts keewe.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus indnat bíeshwotsn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk'. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Iyesus ash ashosh keewoke b́befere, bíndnat bí eshwotsn bínton keeweyo geyat́ úratse bo need'efere botesh. [ <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Manoke teshts ashuwotsitse iko Iyesussh, «Hamb nindnat ni eshwotsn neen keewiyosh geeyatniye úratse boned'iri.» bíet.]<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Wotowa bako Iyesus «Tind kone? Ti eshwots konotsne?» ett bísh bí aaniy. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Maniyere il b́danifwots maants kisho jargdek't kitsfetst hank'o bíet, «Tindnat tieshwots hamb, hanotsiye, <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Darotse fa'o tnih shuntso k'alitu jamwots tíeshuu, t mishu, tindu bonee.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mááy shookirwo ariyets jewro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk'. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Manots aawots Iyesus mootse kesht aats k'ari ganoke be b́dek'i, <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk'. 5:1-3</ref> </char></note> Asho ayat b́maants waat kakuwe b́wtsere bí jelbu ats keshdek't be b́dek'i, ash jamonwere, aats k'ari gúúratse need'dek'tni boteshi. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Maniyere il ay keewo jewron hank'o ett keewo dek't b́tuwi, «Hambe! Goshts iko shook shookosh b́ keshi. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>B́shookoro shook ik iko werindats b́ fed'ere kafwots waat bomeyi. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>K'osh shookonwere shawi aalok dats t'orats fed'b́wtsi, datsmanatsowere shawi ayo bíaaltsotse dashan wokeratse b́tesh, mansh shookman manoor bos'b́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Wotowa eree aawo b́keshtsok'own shoolb́wtsi, s'ap'onowere b́ deshawotse shuuk' b́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>K'osh shookonúwere angitsi t'ugi taalots fe'd'bwtsi, angitsi t'ugmanotswere eent́ maayi bos' man guuk'dek't ooribok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>K'osh shookonwere datsi sheengatse fed'at bos't ay shuwo b́ shuwi, iko balo, iko keez úbo, ikonwere shaash shuwo b́'imi. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Shishet waaz detstso shiye!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jewron b́keewirwo eegosh b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar. 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk'. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Maniyere il b́ danifwots Iyesus maants t'int «Eegoshe nee ash ashosh jewron n keewiri?» bo eti.<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Bíwere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Itsh dari mengstotse aashts keewo dano imere, booshmó imeratse. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mat. 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk'. 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref> </char></note> Detsts ashosh iki boge imeti, bíshowere ayituwe, deshawatsnmó dab b́detstsonor boatse k'aa'úni dek'etiye. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Be'efetsr be'awok'o, shishfetst shiyawok'o bowottsotse wee bot'iwintsrawotse hambe taa jewron boosh keewirwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Mansh nebiyiwo Isayasn hank'o ett guut'etso boatse b́ s'eeneti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‹Shishonó shishirútee, ernmó nibn de'atste,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">Bek'ono bek'etute, ernmó t'iwintsratste,<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashaanots nibo dungutseree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">bo waazo is'eewtseree, bo ááwonwere ship'r wtseree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">mank'o woto b́k'azink'ere, bo ááwon s'iilr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">bowaazonowere k'ewde'er,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">bonibono t'iwintsde'er,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">tmaants boanere boon tkashyank'oni b́teshi.›<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>«Eeŕnmó it ááwwots bo bek'irwotse, it waazwotswere boshishirwotse derekne. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:23-24">10:23-24</ref> </char></note> Arikon itsh keewirwe, nebiy aywotsnat kááwwotsn it itbek'irwan bek'o tewntniye boteshi, ernmó be'atsnee, it itshishirwanor shishosh tewntni boteshi, ernmó shiyatsne.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shook shookirwo ariyetsi biitso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar. 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk'. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Eshe it shookirwon ariyetso eeg b́wottsok'owo k'ewere, <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Weerindi gúúrats fed'ts shooko b́kitsir, Ik'i mengsti aap'o shisht t'iwintsraw ashoniye, manoor Shed'ano waarr b́nibotse shookets keewo k'aa'úb́dek'eti, <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Dats t'orats shooketso b́kitsir, Ik' aap'tso manoor b́shishor genee'uwon dek'et ashoni. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Ernmó manoorisha bako b́ nibotse s'ap'o geeratse, mansh Ik'i aap'atse tuutson gond bek'o wee gishewo bí ats b́bodtsok'on káárni b́dihiti. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Angitsi t'ugi taalotse shooketso b́kitsir, Ik'i aap'o k'ebiru ashoniye, ernmó datsanatsi hasabiyonat gaal shuno b́nibots kindr Ik'i aap'o b́gúk'etwotse shuwalke b́ ooriti. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Sheeng datsats shooketso b́ kitsirwo, Ik'i aap'o t'iwintsdek't k'ebdek'ts ashuwotsiye, man shuwo shuwitwee, iko balo, iko keez úbo, iko shaash shuwo imetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'eron ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Mank'o Iyesus hank'o ett k'osh jewro boosh b́ keewi, «Dari mengstú b́ goshi taalots sheeng shook shookts ashoniye biari, <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Ernmó ash jamo b́k'eyihakon t'elato waat sndewots k'ero shook k'rat k'azbíami. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Sndeyo eent́ b́shuwor k'ero manoor be'eb́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Mann taarman doonz guutswots b́ maants t'int ‹Doonzono! n tarotse shooki sheengo shokat teyatsiya? k'ero eewkneya b́ weyi?› boet. <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Bíwere ‹Han k'altso balangaroniyee› bíet. B́ guutswotswere, ‹Beree amr k'ero nowaat'etwok'o geefiya?› boet. <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Bímó hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy ‹Woteratse k'ero it waat'oor sndewo bínton wat'etute. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Manshe k'ayk'rore, maay kakuwo b́borfetsosh sndewonat k'eron towaar eenne, maay kakuwo b́bodor k'es'irwotssh k'ero shino wad'eree, tawotse b́mis'etwok'owere jil jilon tiferee, sndewonmó kakude'er t t'iwots gac'eree› etetuwe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Senafc' shooku ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk'. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Iyesus manatsdabt k'osh jewro hank'o ett boosh b́keewi, «Ik'i mengstu ash iko dek'amt b́ tarots b́ shookts snafic' aaw arefaniye. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Bihe shook jamotse muk'úniye bíeenormó mit jamoniyere bogfaniyee, mit eenonowere wotitwanee, kafwotswere waarr b jaabats kúto aade'er beetúne.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boot' shashon ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk'. 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Andoor dabt aryidek't b́keewi, «Dari mengstu mááts ikú keez tatsi k'ac'on s'eents buudonton b bad'its boot' shashniye bíari, boot' shash man boot' jamo b́ shashetwok'o b́ k'ali.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus jewron b́ danitso eegosh b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar. 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Iyesus jam keewanotsi jewron ashuwotssh b́keewi, jewralonowere eegor keewratse. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Dub. 78:2</ref> </char></note> Man b́wotirwere nebiyiwon hank'o et guut'etso b́s'eenetwok'owe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">«T keewo jewron aap'etwee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Datsan bi'azeeron tuut aashat beyirwo keewitwe.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'eri jango b́ biitstsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Maniyere il Iyesus ashuwotsi jamik'rat moots k'azbkindi, b́ danifwotswere b́maand t'int, «Taarotsi k'ero ariyetso biitso noosh biishde keewwe» bo eti.<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí aaniy, «Shooki sheengo shooktso ash na'oniye, <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Taaronúwe datsaaniye, shooki sheengmaniye Ik'i mengsti na'na'úwotsiye, k'eronwere Shed'ani na'na'úwotsiye. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>K'erman shookiye balangaro diblosiye, mááy kakwonúwere datsan b́s'uwi dúroniye, k'es'irwotswere melakiwotsiye. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Arikon k'ero waad'de'er b́ saz saazon tifde'er mitsetwok'oo datsan s'uwor mank'o b́ wotiti, <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Manoor ash na'o b́melakiwotsi woshitwe, boowere morro fiinetwok'o k'aliwotsnat gondon finru jamwotsi b́ mengstotse kakude kishitúnee, <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Taaw gop'otso boon bojuwiti, manoknowere k'eet'i eenonat gásh k'aashon wotitwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Kááwotsmó bonih mengstotse aawok'o golitúnee, shishets waaz detstso shiye!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Áátsets gaalo ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Dari mengstú goshi taalots áátsets gaaluniye biari, Ash iko gaalman b́ daatstsok'on aaniy aatsb́k'ri, b́ geneeúwtsatse tuutson amt́ b́ detsts jamo kemdek't goshi datsman kewbdek'i.»<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>Aaninwere Iyesus hnk'owa bíet, «Dari mengstu ink'u geyiru jaaktsoniye biariye, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Jaaktsmanwere ayidek't mangts ink'uwo b́ daatstsok'on amt b́ detsts jamo kemk'rat ink'uman kewb́dek'i.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mus'i kambonton ariyets jewuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Mank'o dari mengstu aats k'arots shap'ets mus'ikambuniye bíariye, biye b́ naar naaron mus'o kakuwituniye, <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>B s'eentsok'on mus' detsirwots aats k'ari gúúratse geetsde kishitúnee, bede'ernwere sheeng sheengo mec'de k'ac'ots gedetúne, gond gondonó okaan juwitúne. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Dúri s'uworowere hank'owe b́wotitiye, melakiwots waarr morretswotsi kááwwotsitse galdek'etúnye. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Gondwotsi taaw gop'ots juwitúne, manoknowere eeponat gásh k'ashone wotitiye.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Ando aaniy Iyesus, «Jam han t'iwintsrteya?» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Bowere «Ee doonzono!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Bíwere, «Eshe dari mengstú sheengshdek't b mist'ryo dants nemo daniífoo, k'ac'i mootse handronat nat wotts k'ac'o de'er weetu k'ac'uwots doonzoni bíariye» ett boosh bíaani.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naazretn Iyesusats bodts k'efo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk'. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Iyesus jewranotsi keew b́ ishakon manoke k'azbíami. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>B́ datso Nazret kito maants waat ayhudiyots Ik' bok'oniru maa mootse ashuwotsi b́danifere b́tesh, shishts jamwotswere adfetst hank'owa bo etfo, «Ashaan danitelefonat adits keewan eewkneya b́dowik'úna? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Hań mito gashde doozfo nayiwoshna? B́ indwere Mariyami eteefúniyoshna? Bí eshwotswere Yak'obi, Yosefi, Sim'onnat Yhudnoshna? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>B́mish mish jametswots hanoke nooknoshna? Eshe ashaan dani telefan eewkneya b́daatsi?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yoh. 4:44</ref> </char></note> Manatse tuutson bín de'aniyere bo oori. Iyesusmó «Nebiywo mango b́ t'ut'et b́ took datsatsonat b́ took maa mec'rotsne» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Aman bok'aztsatse tuutson Iyesus manoke ay adits keewo fineratse b́tesh.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Gupfo Yohansi ud'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk'. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Manoor Gelil dats k'eezfo Herodis, Iyesus shúúts eeni jango b́shishi. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>B́ gútswotssh, «Han gupfo Yohansiye, bíye k'irotse tuure, adits keew jamanots bín bofineyr manshe» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3-4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk'. 3:19-20</ref> </char>
    </note> Herodis Yohanisi detsidek't tipi'moots kindsht tpire b́teshi, man b́k'alwere eegoshe? Bí'eshu Filip'os mááts teshtsu Herodiyad jangatse tuutsone. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lew. 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref> </char></note> Yohans Herodissh, «Nemon ní'eshu máátsu n dek'etwok'o baziyeke!» ett b́ teshtsotsna. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Mansh Herodis Yohansi úd'osha b́geyefo, ernmó Ayhudi ashuwots nebiyiwok'o bín bos'ilfotse ashuwotsi b́shat. <verse eid="MAT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Herodis shuweyi aawots Herodiyad ni'i waat s'eegets ashuwots taalotse k'afefetsat Herodisi b́ geneúshi. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Manatse tuutson Herodis, «N geets keewo taan aatwe! Taawere neesh imetwe!» ett bish b́ taari.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Biwere indú bish b'ízre, «Gupfo Yohans tooko saniyots gerde taash and ime!» biet.<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Nugúsonwere manatse tuutson shiyan b́wtsi, wotowa eree b́ taartsonat bínton mishimaratse beyat teshtswots egetaash boeteti ett Yohans tooko bish imetwok'o bíazazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Mansh tipi moo maants asho woshat, Yohns tooko tipi mootse b́ k'ut'iyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>K'ut'ets tookonowere sahaniyots dek' waat na'úsh boimi, biwere bindsh dek'am imbk'ri. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Yohans danifwotswere waat duuno dek'am duukbok'ri, amtnwere keew man Iyesussh keewbok'ri.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus uts kum ashuwotsi b́maanztsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk'. 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Iyesus Yohans k'iro b́ shishtsok'on jelbots kinddek't ash aal beyok ikok bíaal bewosh bí ami. Ash ashonwere man boshishtsok'on kit kitotse kesht tufoon sha'efere b́ shuutso bo tuwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Iyesus jelbotse b́ oot'tsok'on ay asho bek't boosh maac'o b́k'ewi, boyitse shodetswotsnowere b́kashiy.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Datsonwere b́iltsok'owon b́ danifwots b́ maants t'int́, «Beyokanwo dats basheree, datsonwere ilwtsere, mansh ash asho karnoke fa'a gál gálwotsits amr misho keew bodek'etwok'o damik'rowee» boet.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Ernmó Iyesus, «It bometwo boosh imere bako bo hank'on amo boosh geyiratse!» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>B́ danifwotswere, «Noo hanoke no dets úts tushwotsnat git mus'wots s'uziye» boet.<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Iyesuswere «Manotsi tiyok dowere!» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Maniyere il ash asho sisats bobetwok'o bíazazi, úúts tushonat mus' gitetswotsn k'audek't daromad s'iilt b́ deeriyakon tiitsdek't b́ danifwotssh b́'ime danifwots ashuwotssh bokayi. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Jametswotswere maat bowori, tushi ooronowere, b́danifwots tatse git mishi maron s'eentsdek't bok'aaúwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Maats ashuwotswere máátsonat nana'oniye okoon uts kumok'o bodts nungushwotsi boteshi.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aats k'aratse sha'efere bíamtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar. 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh. 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́ danifwotssh, «Taa ash asho t fakshfetsosh itye jelbúts kindde'er taayere shino bak'ets kimeree,» ett bíazazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Ash ashonowere deen b́k'rihakn Ik' k'onosh gur iko abaats kesh b́dek'i, datso b́ilorowere Iyesus manoke bíaali b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Manoor jelbú aats k'ari taalotse biamiru kaaton bmaand jongiru jongon togefetsat jongon giwuts aatso hake bako jod'eftsatni b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>T'úwitsi jed'i sa'atoniyere il Iyesus aats k'ari abaatse sha'efere b́ danifwotsmand b́weyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>B́ danifwotswere aats k'ari abaatse sha'efe b́waafere bek't ayidek't shatoon tek'bowtsi, «Hanwo meeyee!» ett shatt bokúhi.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Iyesuswere manoor, «Shenwotso! taane shatk'ayere» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Manoor P'et'ros, «Doonzono! Neena wotiyal aatsi abaatse sha'efere twetwok'o taan azazowe!» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Iyesuswere, «Wowe!» bíet. Mansh P'et'ros jelbútse oot't́ Iyesus maants amoosh aats k'aratse sha'o b́tuwi. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Ernmó jongi ango bek't shatb́wtsi, aats gitsots limo dek't b́tuutsok'on, «Doonzono! taan kashiwe!» ett b́kúhi.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Iyesus manoor b́ kisho jargt detsdek't, «Nee n imnetiyo neesh shaptsan eegoshe n t'arat'ariri?» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Iyesusnat P'et'rosn jelbots bokindtsok'on jongo s'k et b́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Jelbútse teshts jamwots, «Arikon nee Ik'o naay neene!» ett Iyesus shinatse gúp'gup'at bosagadi.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus genseret'n shodetswotsi b́kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar. 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Iyesusnat b́ danifwots aats k'aroniyere kimt Genseret' datsats bobodi. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Datsmanatse teshts ashuwots Iyesusi b́woto bodantsok'on gúúrmanatse fa'a beyoke woshat shodetswotsi b́maants de'e weetwok'o bowoshi. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Shodetswotswere b́ tahi jilo bodetsetwok'o bok'oni. Detsts jametswotswere boshodatse bokashi.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Nih nihwots nemi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Maniyakon Iyerusalemitse waats ferisawino eteefwotsnat nemo daifwotsn Iyesus maants waat bín hank'o ett boaati, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«N danifwots, eenashwots nemo eegishe bogakiri, hambe! kisho bomasherawone misho bomeyiri!»<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «It eegishe it nemo kotosh etaat Ik'o aap'tso itgakiri? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:12">20:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Iwi. 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Lew. 20:9</ref> </char></note> Ik'onwo ‹Nindnat nnihn mangiwe, b́ nihnat bíndn c'ashetwoniye k'ire bíyats wotiti› ett azazere. <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Itmó ash iko b́ nihsh wee bíndsh ‹Neesh tk'aliyank'o woshok'o wosh́dek'at́ Ik'osh t'intsree› bí etal, <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>‹Ash man b́ nihi [wee bíndi] mangiyo bísh geyiratse› it etiri, manshe it nemo kup'iyosh etaat Ik' nemo it gaakiri, <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>It tooko danawanotso! it jangosh Isayas hank'o ett b́ keewtso arikee,<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>‹Ash ashaan b́ noonon taan mangirwee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">b́ nibonmó tiyoke woke,<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa. 29:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ash teronat niwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">nemok'o woshdek't danifetst dats mec'ron taan bo Ik'iri.› »<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash kiimshf keewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Manats dabt́ Iyesus ashuwotsi bíyok s'eegt boosh hank'o bí et, «K'ewere! t'iwintsde'ere! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Ash kiimshfo nonotse keshetwoni bako noono maants kinditwoniyaliye!»<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Maniyere il b́danifwots b́ maants t'iindek't, «Ferisawino etfwotssh nkeewan boosh t'ugo b́ wottsok'o danriya?» ett bín boaat. <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Bímó hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Daritstso t nih b́ tohaw mit jamo waad'itwee, <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luk'. 6:39</ref> </char></note> Bo doogwotsnat dogwotsi jishirwotsi bo wottsotse boon k'ayk'rore, dogo dogo b́jishiyal gitetswots gop'otse bo dihiti.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>P'et'rosmó Iyesussh, «Jewrman biitso noosh keewwe» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Iyesuswere hank'owa bíet, «Andoor it t'iwintsrawonya itfa'oni? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Nonots kindiru jamo maac'omants ood'r úroo maants b́keshetwok'o t'iwintsratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mat. 12:34</ref> </char></note> Nonotse keshetwonmó nibotsna b́kesheti, ashono kimshitwo maniye. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Gond asaabo, ash úd'o, wido amo, gobo, úmp'o, kooton gawo, ash shúúts t'afiyo, jamanots ash nibotsne bokeshfoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Ash kimshfwots hanotsi bako masheraw kishon mooniyere asho kimshratsee.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mááts iku biamntsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Iyesus manoke kesht T'irosnat Sidon kitwots maants bíami. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Mann Kana'an dats mááts iku Iyesus maants waat, «Dawit naayo! Doonzono!! t na'ú kim shayiron detseyat b́ kic'irwotse oona neesha taash maac'o k'ewowe!» etaat b kuhi.<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Bímó ikunor noono bish bí aanirawo s'ik et b́wts, manoor b́dnifwots bíyok t'int «Máatsan noshuutso sha'at bkuhirwotse oona! neesha bin denee» ett bok'oni. <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Bíwere aanidek't «Taan wosheyiye Isra'elitse mererwotsk'o t'aftswots mec'roshee» ett bíaani.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Máátsmanmó t'iinat b́ tufishirots tuk'maldek'at «Doonzono! oona neesha taan teúwee!» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Iyesuswere «Nana'úwots misho de'er kanwotssh juwo wotitkaliye» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Biwere «Doonzono! ee arikee, ernmó kanwotswor mishimaratse fed'iru mishi fed'o mááfnee» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Mann Iyesus, «Máátsune neena n imnetiyoniye eene! manshe nshuntsok'o neesh wotowe!» bíet. Máátsman nii'úwere manoori sa'atse kashbwtsi.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus shodets aywotsi b́ kashitsok'owo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Iyesus manoke tuut Gelil aats k'ariganok b́waa, guri abaatse keshdek't beebwtsi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Ay ashuwotswere shoklirwotsi, dogwotsi, durwotsi, gidik'uwotsnat k'osh shodetswotsi dek't Iyesus maants bowaa, b́ tufi shirots beez bok'ri, bí were kashi b́ íshi. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Mann ash asho dutswots noono bokeewfere, duruwots bokaashfere, shoklirwots kaatsdek't boshawefere, aaw dogwots bo s'iilfere bek't adt Isra'elko Izar Izeweri boudi.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus awd kum ashuwotsi b́ maanzitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar. 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Iyesus b́ danifuwotsi b́ maants s'eegdek't boosh hank'owa bíet, «Ashuwots taanton hanoke keez aawo tesht bometwo bodeshawotse boosh maac'o k'ewere, boamor weratse shoolr bodihrawok'o eweeron boon damiyo geeratse.»<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>B́ daniyirwots, «Beree ash jamansh bodet misho worwotse ewknya nodatsiti?» boeti. <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Iyesuswere «Amb́tś mishe it detsi?» ett boon bíaatí. Bowere, «Shawat mishonat muk'na'a mus' nana'úwots fa'ane» boet.<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Maniyeokon, Iyesus ashuwots dats bobetwok'o bíazazi, <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Shawt mishwotsnat mus'uwotsn k'a'údek't Ik'o udt, tiitsdek'tnwere b́danifwotssh b́imi, b́ danifwotswere ash ashosh bokayiy. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Jametswotswere máát bowori, bomááre oortsonowere b́ danifwots kakudek't́ shawat mishimaron s'eents mishifed'o bo k'aaúwi. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Maats ashuwotswere máátsonat nana'on taawerawon awd kum nungushno.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Maniyere il Iyesus ash asho deen b́k'ri, jelbotsowere kinddek't Megedon dats kaywots maants bíami.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Adits keewo bek'osh aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk'. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Ferisawino eteefwotsnat Seduk'awino etefwotsn Iyesusok boweyi, bín fadosh geeyat «Darotse adits keewo noosh kitswe» ett bín bo aati. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Bímó hank'o ett boosh bí aaniyi, «Kooc'on daro b́ bírre it bek'or ‹Bilee b́wotiti› etirute, <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Datso b́gatsor guuron ando ‹Daro daawnar b́ aak'or hambets aawush mango butsetwe› it etiri, dari maac'o bíaro danosh falfte, ernmó dúri milkto dano falratste. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk'. 11:29</ref> </char></note> Gondonat amaneraw s'oot'anots, mililkt bek'o geefne, ernmó nebiyo Yonas milkitoniye oko k'osh milkito imeratse.» Maniyere il Iyesus boon k'azk'rat k'osh beyokok bíami.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ferisawiwotsnat Seduk'awiyots boot' shasho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>B́ danifwots aats k'aroniyere bokimoor batk'rat misho detsde'atsno botesh, <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk'. 12:1</ref> </char></note> Iyesus b́danifwotssh, «Nibn de'ere, Ferisawino etefutsnat Seduk'awino eteefuwots boot'shashatse it atso kordere» bí et.<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Bowere, «Han bí'etir misho dek'woo nok'aztsoshe b́wotiti» ett boatsatseyo bokeeweyi.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Iyesusmó bo asaabirwo dandek't hank'o boosh bíet, «It amanerawotso! ‹Misho node'awoshe› etaat it atsatsewo eegishe it keeweyeri? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mat. 14:17-21</ref> </char></note> Andoor t'iwintsratsteya? Úts misho úts kum ashosh b́ bodtsok'onat oorts mishifed'o ambts mishimaron s'eeno it k'aaútsok'o gawuratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Mank'o shawat misho awd kum ashosh b́bodtsok'owonat oorts mishifed'o ambts mishi maron s'eentso it k'aa'útsok'o t'iwintsratste? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Eshe ‹Ferisawino eteefuwotsnat Seduk'awino eteefuwots boot' shashatse it atso korde'ere!› etaat itsh tkeew mishi jango wotb́k'azo aawk'oneya t'iwintso it k'azi?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>B́ danifwotssh it atso korde'ere bí ettso ferisawno eteefuwtsnat Seduk'awino eteefuwotsn doyatsna bako bo mishi boot'shashatse b́woterawok'o danbodek'.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Mesihiyo b́woto P'et'ros b́gawutsok'owo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk'. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Iyesus Filip'os K'isariyi eteef dats kayuk b́bodtsok'on b́ danifwotssh, «Ashuwots Ash na'osh koni etee boetiri?» ett boon bíaati.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mar. 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Luk'. 9:7-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Bowere, «Ik ikwotsiye ‹Gupfo Yohansiye,› etirune, k'oshwots ‹Eliyasiye› etirune, ando k'oshuwots ‹Ermiyasiyee wee nebiyiwotsitse ikoniye› etfne» boet.<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Iyesuswere, «Itmó koni etfte tasha?» Bíet.<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:66-69">Yoh. 6:66-69</ref> </char>
    </note> Mann Sim'on P'etros aanidek't, «Neehe Krstos neene, Ik'o naay neene,» ett bísh bíaaniy.<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Iyesuswere Hank'o bísh bíeti, «Yona naay Sim'ono! derek neene! han neesh kits darotse fa'o tnihiye bako ashaaliye. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Taawere hank'o etreneesha, nee P'et'ros<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">P'et'rosi: </char><char style="ft">Eto Grik noon keewon shúts s'ala etee. </char></note> neene, shutsi s'alanatsowe Ik' moo agetuwe, Ik' maa mannowere dab k'iri angonuwor da'aratse. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yoh. 20:23</ref> </char></note> Eshe, dari mengstu bín k'eshetwotsi neesh imetwe, datsatse n tiptso darotse tipekee b́wotiti datsatse n biitstso darotse bishke b́wotiti.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh bí Krstosi b́wottsok'owo konshor bokeewrawok'o bí azazi.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus bíats bodetu gond bek'onat k'iri jango tewrero b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-33">Mar. 8:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk'. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Manortson tuut Iyesus b́ danifwotssh hank'o eto dek' b́tuu, «Iyerusalem maants amo taash geyife, manoknowere ee naashuwots, kahani naashuwotsnat nem danifwotsoke gondbek'o tiats bodetwe, taano úditunee, keezl aawonomó k'aytuwitwe.»<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>P'et'rosmó Iyesusi bíaali s'eegdek't́, «Doonzono! woteratse b́jamoona! keewan niats boratse!» etfetst bín fayo dek't b́tuwi.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Iyesusmó wongr ett aanat P'et'rossh, «Nee shed'anono! tshinatse tuuwe! nee ashka bako Ik'iko ní asaaberawotse taash t'uugnenee» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstsos jafrats sha'o bíaatit k'awuntso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mar. 8:34—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk'. 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat. 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk'. 14:27</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'owa bíet, «T jafrats woo geyiruwo b́ tooko juu k'rowe, b́ mask'aliyonowere kurde tshuutso sha'owe. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat. 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk'. 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoh. 12:25</ref> </char></note> B́ kasho kashiwosh geyiru jamo b́ kashitwe t'ut'etwe, b́ kashu t jangosha err t'ut'etwonmó daatsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Asho datsanatsi gaal jamo b́datsiyal, b́ kashunmó b́ t'afiyal eege bísh b́ k'aliti? Wee asho b́kashi shegro k'awntso dashosh falitwá? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Dub. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref> </char></note> Ash na'o b́ nih mangon wotde'er b́ melakiwotsnton weetwe, manóroweree ik ikon boosh bofinok'o bok'awntso dashetwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Arikoniye itsh t keewiri, ash na'o b́ mengsti mangon b́waafere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">B́waafere: </char><char style="ft">Etirwo Girik noon keewon bíamfetso woto falitwe. </char></note> bobek'fetsosh hanoke need'iru ashaanotsitse k'irrawwots fa'ane.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus aro b́ wonetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar. 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk'. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1-5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 P'et'. 1:17-18</ref> </char>
    </note> Shrt aawoniyere il Iyesus P'et'rosi, Yak'abnat Yak'ob eshu Yohansi b́ shutsats s'eegdek't bí aal ayidek't danbaan tuuts guriabats k'azb́kesh. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Manoke boshinatse bíaro wone b́wutsi, b́ shiitsonwere aawok'o b́ goli, b́ tahonwere nas't sháánok'o b́goli. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Musenat Eliyasn Iyesusnton bokeewefere boats be'ebowts. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Manoor P'et'ros Iyesussh, «Doonzono! hanoke nobeyink'eree noosh sheenge, mansh ni'ekitka wotiyal iko neesh, iko Musesh, iko Eliyassh, wotit gof keezwotsi awone» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>P'et'ros man keewoke b́befere goliru daawno boon degb́k'ri, daawn manitsnowere «Tshuntso tna'o tmaac' k'eeztso haníyee, bín k'ewere!» etiru k'ááro b́weyi.<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>B́ danifwots k'aar man boshishtsok'on ayidek't bo tek'tsosh bobaron datsats gúp'gup' bowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Iyesusmó bomaants t'int boon shuu'at «Tuuwere shatk'ayere!» bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Bowere dambaan kááwdek't bos'ile Iyesusiyere okoon konnor be'aatsno.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Guratse oot'oke bobefere Iyesus, «Ash na'o k'irotse b́tuufetsosh it bek'tsan konshor keewk'ayere» ett b́danifwotsi bíazazi.<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mil. 4:5</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ danifwotswere, «Eshé, nem danifwots shino woo bín geyitwo Eliyasiye boetir eegoshe?» Ett bín boaati.<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Iyesuswere aaniy dek't, «Arikee, Eliyasiyere shino weetwe, bíye úno manutsitwee. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat. 11:14</ref> </char></note> Ernmó Eliyas yoots shino waare etirwe itsha, ashuwotsmó bín danatsne, manshe bogeyiru jamo bíats bok'ali. Mank'o ash na'o bokishatse gond bek'o bín geyife.»<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Manoor b́danifwots Iyesus keewirwo gupfo Yohans jango b́wottsokowo boosh galb́gutsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus bí atse fo'erawo b́ fa'a na'o kashitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar. 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk'. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Iyesusnat b́danif keezetswots ash ashomants bo aantsok'on ash iko Iyesus maants waat b́ tufishirots tuk'maldek't hank'o bíet, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>«Doonzono! oona neesha tna'osh maac'o k'ewowe, fo'erawo ayidek't bín gonde b́bek'shiri, tawotso aatsotso ayoto b́dikiri. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>N danifwotsokowere doore b́teshi, ernmó bín kashiwosh falratsne.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Iyesuswere, «It amaneraw dúranatsi s'oot' k'uranotso! awrish b́borfetsone itnton tbeeti? Himo, awrish b́borfetsone iti t k'amiti? Aab na'o t maants dowere!» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Iyesus fo'erawman bí hadi, fo'eronewere na'o atsotse k'az b́keshi, na'amanwere manoor kashb́utsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Maniyere il b́ danifwots bo aal Iyesusok t'int, «Noo fo'erawman kisho nomaaw eegoshe?» ett boaati. <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mat. 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar. 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 K'or. 13:2</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíet, «It amano it k'aztsoshe, arikon itsh keewirwe, senafic' aawi kayuk'o bodts imnetiyu detsfetee wotink'eree gurhansh ‹Hanoke tuur ok amee!› it etal ametuwe, itsh maawetwo eegor aaliye. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Han naari fo'erawo Ik' k'ononat s'oomiyona bako b́ jamon keyatse.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft">Ik ik kishon guut'ets mas'afwots 21 taawa deshatsno. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ k'iri jangonat k'irotse b́tuwi jango gitlo b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk'. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>B́ danifwots Gelil datsatse bokakwewor Iyesus hank'owa boosh bíet, «Ash na'o ash ashuwots kishatse beshiyeyar imetwe. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Bowere bín úd'itune, ernmó keezl aawots k'irotse tuwitwee.» B́daniyrwotswere keewanatse tuutson ayidek't shiyan bowutsi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik' maa ereero dashi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kesh. 30:13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38:26</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesusnat b́ daniyfwots K'frnahomits bobodtsok'on Ik'i moosh err dek'irwots P'et'rosok t'int́, «Iti danifo Ik' maa ereero dashalkeyaa?» ett boaati. <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>P'et'roswere, «Ee dashetwe» bíet. P'et'ros moo maants b́kidtsok'on Iyesus shino, «Sim'ono! eege neesh biari? Datsanatsi naashwots ereero wee t'ilisho bo dek'et konkneya? Bo nana'oknemó uri datsi ashokneya?» ett bíaati. <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>P'et'roswere, «Uri datsi ashaatsne» ett bíaani. Iyesuswere hank'o bíeti, «Beree bo nana'aúwots ereer dashotse aalne eteere? <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Ernmó boosh t'ugo nowoterawok'o aats k'aromaants amr mus'i mak'at'ino sha'úwee, shin shino keshet mus'oodeshde'e, b́nono n wogor bítse gizo daatsitune, manowere de'er taanat neenko daye.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Jamoniyere bogo kone?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk'. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk'. 22:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor b́ danifuwots Iyesusok t'int, «Dari mengstotse jamoniyere bogo kone?» ett bo aati. <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Iyesuswere na'í marmat' iko s'eegdek't bo taalots ned'ib́k'r, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Hank'owo bíeti, «Arikone itsh ti etiri, woneyar nana'í marmat'uwotskok'o woto it k'azal b́ jamon dari mangstots kindratste. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Na'i marmat'ankok'o b́ tooko dashan detsetwo dari mengstotse eene b́wotiti. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Hank'o wotts na'o t shúútsosha err dek'etwo taan dek'etwe.» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashosh t'ug wotaatse ats koti jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar. 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk'. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>«Konwor wotowa asho taan amaniru muk'nana'anotsitse iko b́ dariyoniyere mangts dí'́i shútso b́ bimbats tifde'er ayide dashan gop'ts aatsi k'arotse juweyar k'ot'eeb́wtsink'eree bísh k'aniyank'e.» <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o bíet, «Ash ashuwotssh t'ug wotiru ashuwots jangatse tuutson indowe datsusha! wottso b́ wotiyalor t'ug wotit keewwots bowowo ooreratse, ernmó t'ugo wotitwo b́weetwok'o k'alitumansh indowe bísha! <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat. 5:30</ref> </char></note> Mansh eshe n kisho wee n tufo morro n finitwok'o neen b́daritkawotiyal k'ut'de' juk'rowe! git kisho wee git tufo deshfetsr dúre dúri tawots njuwewoniree kish k'ut'o wee duro wotarr dúre dúri kashomaats kindo neesh k'anefe. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat. 5:29</ref> </char></note> Ni ááwonúwere morro nfinitwok'o neen b́dariyal kishde okaan juk'rowe! git ááwo deshfetsŕ gahanem taw gop'ots njuwewoniyere ááw iketso wotaarr kasho maants kindo neesh k'anefe. <verse eid="MAT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>Darotse fa'a bo melakiwots jam aawo darotse fa'o tnih shiitso bos'iilirwotse, k'ac'in nana'anotsitse dab́ ikonor it gac'erawok'o it tooko korde'ere. [ <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luk'. 19:10</ref> </char></note> Ash na'onúwor b́waa t'aftso kashiyoshe.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft">Ik ik brani mas'aafwotsitse 11 taawatstsan detsfno. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'aft daatsets mereero ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk'. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Ando aaniy Iyesus hank'o bíeti, «Aab eeg arefa itsha? Bal mereer detsts ash iko boyitse iko b́k'aleyal balosh ik shapwotsi guri abaatse k'ayk'rar t'aftsman geyo amaalkeya? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Ariko itsh keewirwe, bín b́daatsor fa'a balosh ik shapwotsiyere t'aft daatsets ikmansh b́gene'úwiti. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Mank'o darotse fa'o itnih nana'a k'ac'nanotsitse ikonwore b́t'fitwok'o geyeratsee.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashaats gond fintsats eeg k'alo b́geyitwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luk'. 17:3</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nieshu neen b́dadiyal neenat bín ikn wotde neesh b́t'afitso keewwe, n keewo b́ shishetka wotiyal aani nik woshdek'etuune, <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Iwi. 19:15</ref> </char></note> N keewo shisho b́k'azalmo wee git wee keez ashuwots gawts gawo b́s'eenetwok'o neenton wee iko wee git asho de'er biyok amee. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Boon k'ewatse bíetalmó Ik' moosh keewwe, Ik'i moonowere k'ewatse bí'etetka wotiyalowere Ik' danawok'o wee morretsok'o taawk'rowe.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:19">16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yoh. 20:23</ref> </char>
    </note> «Arikoniyere itsh tietiri, datsatse it tiptetwoniye darotse tipekee b́wotiti, datsatse it biitsetwo daaratse bishke b́wotiti. <verse eid="MAT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Andoor aaniy itsh keewirwe, ititse gitetswots datsatse eegonor k'onosh ikwotar Ik'o bok'oniyal darotse fa'o t nih itsh s'eentsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Gito wee keezo wotar tshúútson bokakwet beyokoke taa bo dagotse daatsetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Orowe eti jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Manoor P'et'ros Iyesus maants t'int́, «Doonzono! tíeshuu taan b́dadiyal ambtsoto bísh oorowe erta? Shawatoto b́borfetsoneya?» ett bíaati.<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:24">Aze. 4:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere bísh hank'o bíet, «Shawatoti sheba bako shawatot mec'ra eraatse neesha, <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Mansh daritsi mengstu guutswotsnton tanoosh geyiru nugúsoniye bíari, <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Nugusonwere taano dek't b́tuutsok'on ay miliyeniyon meklityo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meklitiya: </char><char style="ft">Eto manoori gizewon fin finiru ash ikosh tatse uts aawosh b́ finere dashef gizoniyere bogts gize. </char></note> bíatse fa'a guuts iko detseyat b́weyi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Guuts man bíatse fa'a k'awntso dasho b́mááwtsotse bíwere b́ máátsunowere b́nan'úwotsnat b́ detsts jamonowere kemde'er bíats fa'a k'awntso b́dashetwok'o b́ doonz bíazazi. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Guutsonmo b́ doonz shirots tuk'maldek't ‹Doonzono! oona neea! muk'i taash s'iilde'e, b́ jamonor neesh dashetwe!› ett bín b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>B́ doonzwere bísh maac'o k'ewat bín faksh b́k'ri, bíatsi k'awntsonoweree k'azb́k'ri.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Ernmó guutsman manoke kesht amoke b́befere bal dinariyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dinariya: </char><char style="ft">Eto ash iko ik aawo b́ finere bísh dashef gizoniye. </char></note> gusho bíatse b́detstso b́ tooho daatsdek't b́ bimbo gúk'dek't, ‹Neesh t gushits gizo taash daye!› bí et. <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Guuts b́ toohmanwere b́tufishirotse diht́ ‹Oona neesha! taash muk'i k'amowee, neesh dashetwe!› ett b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Ashmanmó k'aze bíet. Iki dabnwor detsdek't amt́ b́ k'awntso b́dashfetsosh tipi moots tipi b́k'ri. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Bínk'ó wotts guuts guutswots man bobek'tsok'on ayidek't shiyanbowts, amtinwere wotts jamo bodoonzsh keewbok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>doononwere guutsman s'eegidek't bísh hank'o bíet, ‹Nee gond guutsono! taan nk'onree jam k'awntsman neesh k'azre, <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Eshe, taa niatsi k'awntso neesh k'aztk'rok'o, nee ntooh wotts guutsosh k'azo neesh geyiyank'oshna b́teshi?› <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Mansh doonzo fayat bíatsi k'awnts jamo b́dashfetsosh tipi maa naashosh beshidek't b́ ími.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Eshe itwere ik ikon it eshuwi itnibotse kishde neesh orowe eto itk'azal darotse fa'o tnihwor mank'o it aats k'alitwe.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Kenihonat máátsun faksheyi jango Iyesus b́danitsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Iyesus man keew b́ ishiyakon Gelil datsatse tuut, Yordanos fokoniyere bak'etse Yihud datsats bíami. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Ay ashonwere b́jafrats botuwi, boyitsnowere shodtswotsi b́ kashiyi.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Manoor ferisawino eteefwots b́ maants t'int bín fado geeyat, «Asho b́ máátsu ik jago bt'afiyal manatse tuutsonowere fakshuna bíetal nemo eekituwáá?» ett boaati.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:27">Aze. 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bí aaniy, «Shin Ik'o nungushonat máátson woshdek't boon bíaztsok'o nababeratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aze. 2:24</ref> </char></note> Ando aani ‹Man jangosh asho b́ nihnat bíndn k'aykraar b́ máátsunton ik wotitwe, gitetswotswere ik ats wotitúne› <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Mansh bo maniyak ik atsnee bako gitnaaliyee. Eshe Ik'o s'anddek't ik b́woshtso asho b́ k'alawok'owa.»<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Iwi. 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat. 5:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Ferisawino eteefwotswere, «Béré, Muse eegishe ‹Keniho b́ máátsu b́ fakshetsok'o kitsit werek'eto imr bin fakshwe› bíetiri?» bo et.<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Bíwere boosh hank'owa bíet, «Museyiyere it máátsu itfakshitwok'o bíet itnibo kup' b́wottsi jangatsna bako shin mank'oyiyaliye b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 K'or. 7:10-11</ref> </char></note>Taamó ash iko widatse tuutson b́wotiyalabako b́ máátsu fakshr k'oshu b́dek'al gobetsi wotere» etirwe itsha?<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>B́ danifwotswere, «Kenihe mets jango hank'owi wotiyal mááts dek' k'azo k'anefe» boet.<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Iyesusmó hank'owa bíet «Mank'o keewo bofalitwok'o boosh imetswotssha bako jam ashosh faleratse. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Gat wotat shuwetswots fa'ane, asho boon b́ gatitswotswere fa'ane, Ik'i mengstosh ett botookon botoko gatok'o taawtswots fa'ane, mansha keewan dek'osh falitwo de'e.»<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus nana'o b́deertsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk'. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Manorowere b́kisho boats gerde'er Ik'o boosh b́k'onitwok'o ashuwots nana'o Iyesus maants dek't boweyi, b́ danifwotsmó ash asho bofayi. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Iyesuswere «Dari mengstu hanotsk'owwotssh b́wottsotse nana'í marmat'úwotsi k'ayere t maants wonee, bazik'ayere» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>B́ kishonowere boats b́gediyhakon manoke beshat k'azbíami.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Datsatsi gaalonat dari mengston</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar. 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk'. 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Ik aaw ash iko Iyesusmaants waat «Danifono! dúre dúri beyo daatsosh sheeng keewo k'alosh taan geyitwo eebik'úna?» ett bíaati. <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Iyesuswere, «Sheeng keewi jango eegishe taan ni aatiri? Sheeng wottso Ik' ikoniye, kashomaats kindo ngeyiyalmó b́ tzaziyotsi s'eentswe.» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Kesh. 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Iwi. 5:17-20</ref> </char>
    </note> Ashmanwere, «B́ tzaziyots aawotsnee?» bíet.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Iyesusu hank'o ett bí aani, «Asho ud'k'aye, wido amk'aye, úmp'k'aye, kooton gawk'aye, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kesh. 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Iwi. 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref> </char></note> n nihnat nindn mangiwe, k'osh asho ntookok'o woshde shune, etiru tzaziyotsiye» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Jawets na'amanwere, «Tzazi jamnotsnere s'eentsre, k'osho taash shapitwo eebik'una?» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Iyesuswere, «B́ jamon s'eeno woto ngeyiyalee amŕ ndetstso kemde'er gizman t'owwotssh ime, darotse gaalo daatsitune, tshuutsonowere shoyde wowe» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Jawets na'a manwere, ay gizo b́detstsotse man b́shishtsok'on shiyanefere k'azbiami.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́ danifuwotssh hank'wa bíet, «Arikone itsh tkeewiri, gaalets ashosh dari mengstots kindoniye ayidek't mange. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Andoor itsh keewirwe, Gaalets asho Ik'i mengstots b́ kindoniyere kambulo mafi furotse b́ besho ketefee.»<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>B́ danifuwots man boshishtsok'on ayidek't adt «Beree, kone kashosh faliti?» bo et.<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Iyesus bo maants s'iilt, «Keew han ashosh faletkaliyee, Ik'oshomó jamo faletwe» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Manoor P'et'ros, «Hambe, noo jamo k'azk'rat n jafrats sha'erone, eshe ebiyek'únaa nodatsiti?» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat. 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luk'. 22:30</ref> </char>
    </note> Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíet, «Arikoniye itsh tietiri, Ash na'o b́ mang jorats be b́dek'ots andr datsuwatse tjafrats sha'atswots, it woor tatse git mangi jooratse itbeeti, tatse git Isra'el jirwotsatse angshitutee. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>T jangosh err b́ moowwotsi, wee bí eshwotsi, wee b́ mishotsi, b́nihnat b́idono, wee b́nana'o, wee b́gosho k'azts jamo baloti gito dek'etwe, dúre dúri kashonowere daatsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat. 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk'. 13:30</ref> </char></note> Ernmó and shints wotts aywots shuuts oortswotsi wotitúne, shutsts wottswots shintswotsi wotitune.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Weyini mitwotsitse finit ashuwotsi k'at'arefok'o ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>«Dari mengstú woyini miti beyoke finiru ashuwotsi k'at'arosh guuron keshts miti doonzoniye biariye. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Bí ik ik aawosh ik ik dinariyo dashosh keeweyat, finirwotsi weyini mitook b́woshi. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Keez sa'atok'on kesht, fino bitst jebatse need'iru k'osh ashuwotsi b́bek'i, <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>‹Itwere weyini mit boyok amr finore. Itsh imo geyit k'awntso dashetwe› bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Bowere weyini miti datsok boami, ando aaniy shrt sa'atonat jed'iy sa'atok'on kesht mank'o b́k'ali. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Tatse ik sa'atok'onowere k'osh ashuwotsi bo need'efere daatsdek't ‹Itmó aaw jamo fino bitsat hanoke it need'ir eegishe?› ett bíaati. <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Bowere ‹Noon k'at'arit asho t'út'atniye› boeti, bíwere ‹Beree itwere weyini mitwots beyok amr finore› bíet.<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Lew. 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Iwi. 24:15</ref> </char>
    </note> «Datso b́iltsok'on weyini mitwots doonz fin manatse b́naashitsosh ‹Finirwotsi s'eerr ili k'at'aretswotsatse tuuzr shin k'at'aretswotsok b́borfetsosh bofintsi k'awntso boosh daye› bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Mansh tatse ik sa'aton k'at'aretswots ik ikon t'int ik ik dinariyo bodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Shin k'at'aretswots bot'intsok'on bogshde bodek'etwok'o boosh bíar, ernmó boowere ik ikon ik ik dinariya bodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Gizo k'aaú dek't́ weyini mito doonzats hank'o ett bomumundi, <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>‹Hanots il waat bofin ik sa'atoshe, ernmó aaw jamo aaw k'es'atse mis'fetsat maawron jintswotsnton nonoton taal woshnk'ri.› <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Weyini miti doonzonwere, finirwotsitse ikosh hank'o ett bí aaniyi, ‹T mashono! neen eegor daderatsee, nokewe ik aawon neesh ik dinariyo dashoshoshnaa? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Eshe nbano de'er amee, neesh tímtsok'o bodtso iltsanshowere imo shunre. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>T took gizatse tshuntso k'alosh alo detsfoshna? Himo taa tewud doo twottsoshee nee n okoori?› »<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat. 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar. 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk'. 13:30</ref> </char>
    </note> Maniyere il Iyesus, «Mank'o, shuutstsi teshtswots shintsi, shintsi teshtswots shuutstsi wotitune» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́k'iri jangonat k'irotse b́ tuwi jango útslo b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk'. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Maniyere il Iyesus Iyerusalem maantsan bíamfera b́tesh, amoke bobefere weeratse tatsegit b́danifwotsi boaali b́ maants s'eegdek't́ dek'amt́ hank'o boosh bíet, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Hamb, Iyerusalem maantse noamiri, manoknee Ash na'o kahni naashwotsnat nemo danifwotssh beshide imetwe, boowere k'iri angsho bíats angshitúnee. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Ik'i ashwoteraw ashuwotssho beshide imetúnee, boowere trgc'o bíatso kaashetúne, bíno garafituno, bín jiitetúnee, ernmó keezl aawots k'irotse tuwitwee.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zebdiwos nana'úwots ind Ik'o k'on k'ono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Maniyere il Zebdiwos nana'úwots ind, b nana'úwotsnton Iyesusmaants t'iinat b́ shinatse tuk'maldek'at ik keewo bish b́ k'alitwok'o bín b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Iyesuswere, «Eege ngeyiri?» bí eti. Biwere, «N mengstotse t nana'a gitets hanots iko giro maants, iko k'ano maants bobeetwok'owo taash woshwe!» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Iyesusmó «It itk'onirwo danatste, taa karnon túshet gondbek'i wanc'o úshosh falituteya?» bíet. Bowere «Ee falitwone!» boeti.<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Iyesuswere, «Arikon taa t úshet gond bek'i wanc'o úshetute, ernmó k'anonat giromaants bobetwok'o k'alitwo taanaliye, beyokman imetiye tnih boosh b́ k'anits ashuwots s'uzshe.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>B́ danif tatswots bok'onts k'onman boshishtsok'on eshu git manotsats fayogedbok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Iyesusmó jametswotsi s'eegdek't hank'o boosh bí eti. «Ik' danaw ashuwotsatse naashtswots bo ash ashaatse alknee, boon jishirwotswere boon boaalefook'o danfte. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Luk'. 22:25-26</ref> </char></note> It dagotsnere mank'o woto geyiratse. Ernmó it dagotse een wot geyirwo it guuts wotowe. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat. 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk'. 22:26</ref> </char></note> Mank'o ititse bogo wotosh geyirwo it guutso wotowe. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Ash na'oniye bí finar ayuwotsi kashiwosh b́ kasho beshide imoshe b́weyi bako bísh fineyishaliyee» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Maniyere il Iyarikoyitse kesht boamfere ash ash aywots Iyesus jafrats botuwi. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Ando weeri gúratse beyiru ash aaw dog gitetswots man weeron beshirwo Iyesusi b́ woto boshishtsok'on «Dawit naay doonzono! oona neesha, noosh maac'o k'ewowe!» ett bokuhi.<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Ash ashonwere «Ishooree!» ett boon bofayi, bomó «Dawit naay doonzono! oona neesha noosh maac'o k'ewowe!» et fetst ayidek't bokúhi.<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Iyesuswere need'dek't́ boon s'eegt «Itsh eeg tk'ale itgeyiri?» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Bowere «Doonzono! no ááwwots bok'eshetwok'o woshwe!» boeti.<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Iyesuswere boosh maac'o k'ewat bo ááwwotsi b́shuuí, bo ááwwotswere manoor bobek'i, boowere Iyesus jafrats boami.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus mangi eenon Iyerusalemits b́kindtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:1-11">Mat. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk'. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Iyesusnat b́ shuuts sha'irwots Iyerusalem maants bot'inor Debrezeyitn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Debrezeyiti: </char><char style="ft">Eto Zeyiti mitwots bíatse bodaatsef gurooni. </char></note> Bete Faageyi eteef galúts bobodtsok'on Iyesus b́danifwotsitse gitetswotsi hank'o ett woshbk'ri, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>«It shinatse fa'a galúts ameree, manokowere itbodtsok'on daaz iku bnaúnton tipetsu daatsitute, biishdeniye taash de'ewore. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Asho konwor ikjago itn bíaatiyal ‹Doonzo boon b́geyirwoshee› erere. Bíwere daaz daazwotsi manoor doyitwe.» <verse eid="MAT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Man b́wotye nebiyiwon hank'o ett keewetso b́ s'eenishe,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek. 9:9</ref> </char>
    </note> «S'iyon mááts naúsh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">S'iyon mááts naúsh: </char><char style="ft">Etirwan Iyerusalem kitu kitsoshe. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‹Hambe! Nnuguso bíatso dash detsedek't daazunat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">B́naú ats wotde n maants weetwe!› err bish keewwere.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>B́ danifwotswere amt Iyesus boosh b́ keewtsok'o bo k'ali. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Daazunowere b na'úntoon bíyok dek't boweyi, botahonowere daazwots jik'ats gedbok'ri, Iyesuswere bíyats be b́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Ash ashotse aywots botaho werindats ees'bok'ri, k'atsetswotswere maarets miti jaabo k'ut'dek't weerindatse boes'fera botesh. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Ash shin shinatse amiruwotsitsnat b́ jafratse weyirwotsitse teshtswots, «Hosa'ano Dawit naayshe! Doonzo shútson weetwo deereke! hosa'ana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hosa'ana: </char><char style="ft">Eto Ibrayist'y noon keewon kashiwe, oona neesh noon kashiwe eteb́ wotor, Hanoke gut'etsanmó uda etee. </char></note> darotse!» ett bo kuhefera botesh. <verse eid="MAT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Iyesus Iyerusalemits b́ kindor kititsi ash jamo, «Han kone bí?» eton dimbirbowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Ash ashonwere, «Han Gelil datsatse fa'o Nazretitse waatso nebiyiwo Iyesusiye.» bo etí.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Maniyere il Iyesus Ik' moots b́ kindi, manoknowere kemiruowtsnat keewiru ash jamo kish b́ ishí. Giz woniyiruwots maronat kurkund kemirwots jooronowere gúp'sh b́ ishi. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa. 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Erm. 7:11</ref> </char></note> « ‹T moo Ik' k'oni maa eteetwe› ett guut'ere, itmó bík'tswots gemook'o woshrte!» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Iyesus Ik' mootse b́befere ááw doogwotsnat shoklirwots b́ maants bo waare b́kashiyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Ernmó kahniy naashwotsnat nem danifwotsn Iyesus b́ k'alts adits keewo bobek'tsonat nana'i marmat'uwots Ik'i mootse «Dawit naaysh hosa'ana!» etfetst bokuhefere boshishtsotse bofayi. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Dub. 8:2</ref> </char></note> Mansh Iyesussh «Nanaúwots bo etirwo k'ebirwiya?» boeti, bíwere «Ee, k'ebirwee, ‹Nana'uwotsnat s'aats úshirwots nonotse udo k'anirnee› etirwo b́ jamon nababeratsteya?» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Boon k'azk'rat kitotse kesht Betaniya eteef galúts bíamí, manoko b́k'eeyi.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ c'ashts belesi mitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Iyesus dats gats guuron kito maants aanat amfetst k'ak'b́wtsi, <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Belesi mit iku weerindi gúúratse bek't b maants bíami, ernmó biyatse maara bako eegor daatsratse. Mansh «Haniyehak b́ jamon shuwo níatse b́datserawok'owa!» bíet. Mitúnuwere manoor shuuk'bwtsi. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>B́ danifwots man bobek'tsok'on «Belsi mitan iknun aawk'oneya shuuk' bgutsi?» ett bo'adi. <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 K'or. 13:2</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «Arikone itsh tkeewiri, imnetiyo deshr t'arat'aro itk'azink'ere belesi mitu atsats k'aletsok'o k'almec'ro b́woterawon dab gurhansh ‹Hanoke tuur aats k'arots shap'ewe!› it etal itsh s'eenetwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Amanar Ik' it k'onitu jamo daatsitute.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus awuk'o alon b́finirwok'owo aatetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk'. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Iyesus Ik' moots kind dek't daniyo dek't b́tuwi. Manoor kahni naashwotsnat ashitsi eenashwots b́ maants t'int «Jaman nk'alirwo eegi aloneya? Alhanowere neesh imtso kone?» Ett boaati. <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Iyesuswere hank'o et boosh bíaaniy, «Taawere ik keewu iti aatuna, ti aattsu taash it aniyalee taawere jaman kon alon t k'alirwok'o itsh keewitwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Yohans gupo eewkneya b́weyi? Darotsneyamo ashokneya?» Bíere, bo boatsatseyosh hank'o ett boshiyeyi. « ‹Darotsne› noetal ‹béréé, eegoshe bín amano it k'azi› noosh bí'eteti, <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>‹Ashokike› noe'talmó, Yohansi jamwots nebiyok'o bos'ilirwosh, ashuwotsi noshati.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Manshe, «Danatsone» ett boaaniy. Bíwere «Taawor jamhan eegi alon tk'alirwok'o itsh keewratse» bí et.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nana'a gitetsuwotsi ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Manats dabt boosh hank'owa bí et, «Ash iko nana'a gitetswotsi detsfe b́tesh, boyitse iko maants t'int, ‹Tnaayo! hambets t weyini miti beyoke amr fino nfinitwok'owa› bíet. <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>B́naaywere ‹K'aze amatse› bíet. Ernmó il goynat finosh bíami. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Nihonwere b́naay ikok ando amt́ bíshowere mank'o b́ finitwok'o bín bíazazi, ‹Wotowe tniho ametuwe› bíet. Ernmó amatse. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Eshe gitetsanotsitse b́ nih alo s'eentstso ááwnee?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Bowere «Shintsoni!» boeti, Iyesuswere boosh hank'o bíeti, «Arikoniye itsh tietiri, morretswotsnat gobetswotsn dari mengstots kindosh itiyere shinitunee. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk'. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7:29-30</ref> </char></note> Gupfo Yohans kááwi weerindo itsh kitsosh b́ waare bín amaneratste, morretswotsnat gobetswotsmó bín amanernee, hanowere bek'aat dab naandrone etaat amaneratste.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woyni bos'uwotsi toktswotsn aridek't jewretso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar. 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk'. 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Iyesus dabt hank'o bíeti, «K'osh jewro k'ewere, woyni mitwotsi tokts ash iko fa'e b́tesh, bí b́ weyini mit gúratse kas'o kas'bk'ri, weyini fis'eet gop'o ishdek't b́doozi, weyini kotosh wotit kaki geenzo agb́k'ri, maniyere hakon mitwots beyoko goshtswotssh kirayik'rat k'osh datso maants k'az bí'ami. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Mit shuwi woro b́bodtsok'on b́ bano bísh bodek'etwok'o b́ guutswotsi goshtswotsok b́woshi. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Goshtswotsmó guutswotsi detsdek't iko botogi, iko boúd'i, k'oshonowere shútson botogi. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Weyini mitwots doonz ando botaawo baltswotsiyere bogts k'osh guutswotsi aaniy b́woshi. Goshtswots boatsowere baltswotskok'o bo fini. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Jamoniyere il weyni miti doonzo ‹T naayno mangitunee!› eton b́ naayi goshtswotsok b́ woshi. <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Ernmó goshtswots b́ naayi bobek'tsok'on ‹Hanwo naatetwoniye›, woore úd'k'rar b́ detstsono naarde'onee!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>B́ naaynowere weyini miti beyokoniyere ur dek'amt úd'bok'ri.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Eshe, weyini mitwots doonz b́woor goshtsanotsi eeg b́k'alitwok'o arefa itsha?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Bowere «Gond ashmanots s'uwatse boon gondo bek'shr t'afik'ritwe. Weyniy miti beyokonowere b́ shwono finde woor woron bísh kayitu goshts k'oshwotssh kiraayi b́k'riti.» boeti.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Dub. 118:22-23</ref> </char>
    </note> Manats dabt́ Iyesus hank'owa bíeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">«S'ayin mas'aafotse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">‹Ginbiyon maa agfwots bo gac'ts shútso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">bíye shúts kup'o tungúshatse kaatsde detsetwo b́woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Hanwere doonzo finoniye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">no ááwwotsshowere adike,›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 21:42">ett guut'etso b́ jamon nababeratsteya?<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>«Eshe hank'o etirwe itsha, Ik'i mengsto itatse de'er shuu shuwitu ashuwotssh imetwe. [ <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Shútsanats dihitwo tishitwee, shútsman bíatsats b́ dihit ashonmó gaans'eetwee.»]<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Kahni naashwotsnat ferisawino eteetswots jewretsanotsi boshishtsok'on Iyesus b́ keew bo jang b́wottsok'owo t'iwintsbodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Mansh bín detso geyatni botesh, ernmó ash asho bín nebiyiyok'o bos'ilfotse shatbowtsi.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Jiwok s'eegetso ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk'. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Iyesus aaniy hank'o ett jewron boosh b́keewfere b́teshi, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Dari mengsto b́ na'osh jiwu k'anits nugúsoniye biariye. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Nugúsman b́ jiwok b́ s'eegets ashuwotsi boweetwok'o gawiyosh b́ guutswotsi bomaants b́woshi, ashuwotsmo jiwman maants wosh geratsno.<verse eid="MAT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>«Nugúsman k'osh guutswotsi aaniy hank'o ett b́woshi, ‹S'eegets ashuwotsok amrniye, Hamb, jiwosh meetwonat úshetuwone k'anik'rere minz gatwotsnat k'otsts shopwotsi shúkk'reree, jam keewo k'anwtsere, mansh jiwi moonat úshok woore!› err boosh keewwore. <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Boomó keewman aatsni k'rat bokaat kaaton iko b́ goshomand iko b́ jaakomand bíami. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Oortswotswere b́ guutswotsi detsdek't ketiyon jot'dek' boúd'i, <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Manoor nugúso fayat kes' kes'f bíkwotsi woshat úd'ts manotsi úd'iibk'ri. Bo kitinowere tawon bo mitsitwok'o b́woshi, <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Maniyere il b́ guutswotssh hank'o bíeti, ‹Hamb, jiwi moonat úshon k'anwtsere, s'eegetswotsmo jiwansh woteraniye orernee. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Mansh weerindatse amr itdatsts ash jamo jiwi moonat úshomand s'eere.› <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>B́ guutswotswere weer weerats amt bodaatsts ash jamo gondwotsno, sheengwotsnowere kakubok'ri, mann jiwi maa eeno s'eegetswotsn s'eenb́wtsi.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Ernmó Nugúso s'eegetswotsi s'iilosh jiwi maa eenots b́kindtsok'on, manoke jiwi taho taheraw iko bek'b́k'ri. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Bísho hank'o bíeti, ‹T masho, jiwi taho ntaherawo aawk'oneya hanok n kindi?› ash manwere s'ik bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk'. 13:28</ref> </char></note> Nugúsonwere b́guutswtssh, ‹B́ kishonat b́ tufoon tifde'er kishr úratse fa'a t'aluwots juwore, manoknowere eeponat gash k'ashone wotiti› bíet.» <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Manats dabt́ Iyesus «Eshe, s'eegetswots aynee, bitsere marat'etswotsmó múk'nee.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Maniyere hakon ferisawino eteefwots amt aawk'o k'alr Iyesus noono b́ keewor bín bodetsetwok'o boshiyeyi, <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Bo danifwotswere, Herodis ashuwotsnton Iyesusok woshat, «Danifono, neehe arkeewetso nwottsok'onat Ik'o weerindo arikon ndaniyirwok'o danfone ash shatonowere nk'aliru keewo aaliye, ashonat ashi dagonowere boga bogshratsnee.» bísh bo etiyakon, hank'o ett boaati. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>«Aab́ noosh keewwe neesh eeg arefa? Rom nugúsosh ereero dasho nemeemó nemaalnee?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Iyesusmó bo gondo dank'rat, «It it took danawwotso! eegoshe tiyatse t'awo it geyiri? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Ereerosh dasheyiru gizo aab taash kitswere!» bíet. Mansh bo ik dinariyo dek'wat bísh bokitsi. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Bíwere, «Aranatse dozets aronat guut'ets shúútson konke?» eton boon bíaati, <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Bowere, «Rom dats nugúsoke!» boeti, bíwere, «Eshe nugúsoko nugúsosh, Ik'iko Ik'osh imere,» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Bowere bín bok'ebiyakon b́ keew keewatse tuutson adt k'azk'rat boami.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">K'irtswots botwi jango aatetsok'owo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk'. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Manots aawots, «K'irtswots k'irotse tuwo aaliye» etef Seduk'awino eteefwots Iyesusok waat hank'o ett bín bo aati, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Iwi. 25:5</ref> </char></note> «Danifono! Muse ‹Ik asho na'o b́shurawo k'iron b́ maatswatse b́ k'aleyal k'irts eshuwo máátsu de'er k'irtsosh shááto shegrshwee,› etre. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Shawat eshuwots nooke fa'ane boteshi, jamwotsitse k'aabo máátso dek't na'o b́shurawo k'irb́wtsi, mansh bíeshu muk'efo k'irtso máátsu b́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Mank'o gitlonú, keezlonú shawatlok b́borfetso tar taron bin dek't bok'iri. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Jamoniyere il máátsman k'ir b́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Eshe, shawatwots bin bodek'tsotse k'irtswots botuwor mááts b wotit aawshe?»<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Iyesusmó hank'o ett boosh bíaaniy, «It s'ayin mas'afwotsnat Ik'i ango it danawotsnee it sheliri. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>K'irtswots k'irotse botwots darotse fa'a melakiwotskok'owa bowotiti bako de'atsno, de'eratsne. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>K'irtswots tuwi jango itsh Ik'o b́ keewtso nababeratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>Bíye hank'owe bíeti, ‹Taa Abraham Ik'o, Yisehak' Ik'o, Yak'ob Ik'o taane› Mansh Ik'oniye kashetswots Ik'a bako k'irtswots Ik'aliye.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Ash ashonwere man boshishtsok'on b́ daniyatse tuutson boad.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jamoniyere bogts tzaziyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk'. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Iyesus Seduk'awino etefwotssh noono boaanirawok'o woshdek't s'ik boetetuwok'o b́ wosho boshishtsok'on ferisawino eteyirwots ik wotdek't kakwe bowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35-40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk'. 10:25-28</ref> </char></note> Boyitsnowere nemo danif iko, Iyesusi fado geeyat hank'o ett bíaati, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Danifono! nemotse jamoniyere bogts tzaziyo aawne?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Iwi. 6:5</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere hank'o ett bísh bíaaniy, «‹Doonzo n Ik'o Izar Izeweri n níb s'eenon, n kash jamon, n maac' s'eenon shune,› <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Jamoniyere bogetsonat shints tzaziyo haniye. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref> </char></note> Hanowere artso gitl tzaziyo ‹K'osh asho n tookok'o woshde'er shune,› etirwoniye. <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Nemonat nebiywots daniy jamo tzazi gitetsanotsatś need' dek'kne.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesihyo aatets aato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk'. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Ferisawino eteefwots kakuwedek't bobefere Iyesus hank'o ett boon bíaati, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Krstos jango eege it etiri? kon naayi arefa itsha?» boowere «Dawit naayiye» ett bísh boaaniy. <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Iyesuswere boosh hank'owa bíet, «Beree, Dawit Ik'i shayiron jisheyat b́ keewor eegoshe ‹Doonza!› et bín b́s'eegi?<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Bí ‹Doonzo t doonzsh:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">n balangarwotsi ntufishirots t woshfetsosh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">t k'anomaants beewe!› bíet.<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Eshe Dawit b́ tookon ‹Doonza› ett b́s'eegyhakon bere Krstos aawk'oneya b́ naayi woto b́faliti?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Mann dab ik nonunor bísh aaniyosh faltso aali b́tesh, manots aawoniyere hakon bín aatosh aaw shúk'tso konúwor aali b́ tesh.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Muse nemo danifwotsnat ferisawiyotsatse it atso korde'ere bíettsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk'. 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Maniyakon Iyesus ash ashonat b́ danifwotssh hank'o ett b́ keewi, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>«Nemo danifwotsnat ferisawino eteefwots Muse jorats bedek'rne. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Mansh eshe bo itsh bo keewts jamo k'alwere, korde'ere, bo bofinirwonmó fink'ayere, bo bokeewirwo finats jitsraknee, <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Mangonat kic'its kuro tipdek't ash mangrats bokurifoni, botookishomó bojaabon t'awiyosh dab́ geeratsne. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mat. 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Taaw. 15:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Iwi. 6:8</ref> </char></note> Bofin jamo asho boon b́bek'etwok'owa etniye bofiiniri. Ik'o bok'onor kitabiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kitabiya: </char><char style="ft">Eto nemo bíts guut'etso bobaronat boilats botipfoni. </char></note> genzit bo gawintsiri, Ik' nem kotirwok'o botahefonowere b́ guuratsi s'aaro shipdek'tni bo geenzifoni, <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Jiwoke mang beyoko, ayhudiyots Ik' bok'onf mooke shints beyokoniye detso boshunfoni. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Jebatsnowere ash jamo boosh gup' gup'aar jamo boon aatr ‹Danifono!› err bo s'eegetuwok'owe bogefoni, <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Itmó itko danifo ik s'uzo b́wottsotsnat it jametswere esshwwotsi it wottsotse ‹Danifono› eteyar s'eegek'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Ando aaniy it itdetsts niho darotse ik s'uzo b́wottsosh datsatse konnor ‹Nihono› err s'eegk'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Iti danirwo Krstos s'uzi b́wottsosh ‹Daniruwono› err s'eegeyo k'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mat. 20:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar. 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">10:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk'. 22:26</ref> </char></note> Ititse eeno it guutso wotowe. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk'. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref> </char></note> B́ tooko dambaan detsetwo dashan aanitwe, b́ tooko dashan detsetwo dambaan wotitwe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nem danifwotsnat Ferisawino eteefuwots bo atso bodartsotse b́faytsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luk'. 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>«Asho dari mengstots b́ kindrawok'o, b́ fengesho is'iruwots it itgit alberetswotso, nemo danifuwotsnat ferisawino eteefuwotso! indowe itsha! it ittokoosh bíts kindratste, kindosh geyirwotsnowere bokindrawok'o bazirutee! [ <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Nem danifuwotsnat ferisawino etfwotso, be'ewosha etaat geenzidek'at Ik'o it k'onirwats weebdek'at t'oow máátsuwots detstso ishbaziruwotso indowe itsha! manshe itatse ikibog angsho bodetuwe.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft">Matiyos mas'fotsere tatse awdl taawan aaliye ik ik shin kishon guut'ets mas'fotse aaliye, Mar. 12:40 nat Luk'. 20:47 atse fa'ee. </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>It took danaw nem danifwotsnat ferisawiwotso! indowe itsha! ayhudi woteraw ash iko ayhudi imnetiyo maants woniyosh datsatsno aats k'aratsno sha'at it gúriri, kindsh itdek'tsok'onowere, itiyere gitkisho ikibogo gahanemsh k'antso woshirutee!<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«It jishiru dooguwotso! indowe itsha! ‹Asho Ik' k'oni moon b́taariyale, eegor woteratse› etfte, ‹Ik' k'oni mootsi awntson b́ taariyalmo taarman bín detsetwe› etirute, <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>It shiyawwotsnat doogwotso! awntsonat awnts s'ayintsitu Ik'i mootse ááw bogfa? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Mank'o ‹Asho wosho t'intseyiru bewokoki t'arap'ezon b́ taariyal eegor woteratse,› woshman t'intseyiru k'ac'atse fa'a woshon b́taariyalmó taaro bín detsetwe etirute. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>It doogwotso! woshonat woshman s'ayintsitu wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezoniyere ááw bogfa? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Eshe wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezon taarirwo, wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezonat wosh t'intseyiru t'arap'ezatse fa'a keew jamone b́taariri. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Ik' moon taarituwo, Ik' moonat Ik'mootse fa'a Ik'one b́taariri. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa. 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat. 5:34</ref> </char></note> Daron taaritwonwere Ik'o mangi jooronat b́ jooratse beyirwonee b́ taariri.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew. 27:30</ref> </char>
    </note> «It git alberets nem danifwotsnat ferisawiwotso! indowe itsha! arshudiko, k'ushuwiko, orobrikono tatslo imirutee, ernmó nemotse een eenwotsi k'azniye it k'riri, boowere kááw angshwotsi, orowe etonat amanetso wotoniye, ekeewi itk'ayawo hanoor k'alo itn geyife b́ teshi. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>It jishiru doogwotso! it úshiru jamwotso s'ungok'o muk'nana'a wottswotsi s'aldek'at it juwiri, kambulok'o een keewonmó it k'oot'iri!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«It git alberets nemo danifwotsnat ferisawiwotso! indowe itsha? B́rc'k'onat saniyon úriweertso s'ayintsirute, b́ gitsonmó biik'onat jaalon bín s'eenke, <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Nee dog ferisawiyono! shin shino brc'uk'onat saniyon b́ gitso s'ayintswee, manoor b́bootsonúwere s'ayin wotituwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«It git alberets nem danifwotsnat ferisawiwotsn indowe itsha! bogitsotse ash duuni mak'tsonat kim keewo bítse s'eents, bo úronmo nora eteets nas' k'alamiyo fuutere sheengiru doowwotsiye it ariye. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Mank'owere it, úratse ashosh ash kááwo araatniye it be'eyiri, it gitsonmó git alberetsonat gondo s'eenwtsere.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«It git alberets, nem danifwotsnat ferisawiwotso! indowe itsha! it nebiywots dowoniye it agiri, k'irts kááwwots hawltiyoniye it shengshiri. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>‹Nonih shintswotsntoni noteshi wotink'ere nebiyiwots s'atso kuut'r bonton ikwoterawnk'one b́teshi› etirute. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Eshe, nebiyiwotsi úd'ts ashuwots nana'o it woto it tookon gawirute. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Eshe, it nihots dek' botuutso it were s'eentswere. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mat. 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk'. 3:7</ref> </char></note> It dawnzwotso, dawnz nana'úwotso, gahanemits fayotse aawk'o k'alrniya oorosh it faliti? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Mansh hamb, taa nebiyiwotsi, dantelefetswotsi, danifwotsi it maants dowittwee, boyitse ik ikuwotsi úd'itutee, ik ikuwotsi jitetutee, ik ikwotsnowere bo Ik' k'oni mootse togetute, ik kitotse ik kitomaad gishitutee. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Aze. 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Zen. 24:20-21</ref> </char></note> Manatse tuutson kááwo Abeel s'atsatse de'er Ik'i moonat wosh t'intseyiru t'rap'ezi dagotse it úd'tsok b́ borfetsosh Berakiyu naay Zekariyas s'atsats b́ borfetsosh datsats kud'ts kááwwots s'atsatse tuuts fayo itatsatse b́bodeti, <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Arikoniye itsh tkeewiri, fay jamaaniye, and dúranatse shuwetsanotsats bodetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Iyerusalem jangosh bíeptsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk'. 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>Manats dabt́ hank'owa bíet, «Iyerusaleme, Iyerusaleme! nee nebiywotsi úd'irunee! nmaants woshetswotsi úd'at shútson togirunee! baaku b nana'o b gop'shots b kakufok'o, taawor n nana'o ikok kakuwosh ambtsote t geyi! itmó geratste. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Erm. 22:5</ref> </char></note> Eshe hambe, it moo bashar oritwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Dub. 118:26</ref> </char></note> Manshe ‹Doonzo shútson wetuwo deereke› it erfetsosh haniye il taan be'atste etirwe.»<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' moo b́ gaahi jango Iyesus b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk'. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Iyesus Ik' mootse kesht bíamfere b́ danifwots Ik' maa gmbiyo kitsosh b́ maants bot'iini. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Bíwere «Jaman bek'irute? Arikone itsh tkeewiri, shúts iko ikats b́kororetsok'on gaaheraniyere ooritwo aaliye» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo wooniyere shinon weet gisheyonat gondbek'on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:8-19">Luk'. 21:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Debre zeyiti guratse Iyesus b́ befere b́ danifwots bo aal b́ maants t'int «Jam keewan b́wotit awre? N woonat dúri s'uwi milikito eebi?» ett boaat.<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Iyesus hank'o ett boosh bíaani «Konwor asho itn b́darirawok'o itatso korde'ere! <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Aywots ‹Taa Krstos taane!› etfere t shútson weetune, ay ashuwotsnowere daritúnee. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Kes'i k'aaronat kes'i keewon shishetute, jaman b́ wotitwotse tek'k'ayere, b́ s'uwonmó borafa'ee. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Asho ashaats tuwitwee, mengstonúwere mengstats kes'osh tuwitwe, besh beshar ik ik datsatse k'ak'onat dats shek'ewo wotituwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Jaman na'a shuwo it'i shambo b́ tuuwortsok'oyiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">10:22</ref></char></note> Manoor ash ashuwots iti gondbek'osh beshide'er imetúnee, iti úd'itúne, t shúútsosha err ash jamwotsoke shit'eek wotitute. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Manoor aywots bo amantso haalar shuuts aanitune, iko iko beshide imetwe, ashuwots boatsatseyewo shit'etune. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Kootets nebiy aywots tuwitune, aywotsnowere shelitune, <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Gondo b́ aytsatse tutson, ay ashuwots shuno aak'wtsitwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat. 10:22</ref></char></note> S'uwaats b́borfetso k'amde kup'itwonmó kashitwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Ash jamosh gaw b́ wotitwok'o Ik'i mengsti doo shishiyan dats jamatse nabeetwe, manoor dúr s'uwo weetwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kic'it gondbek'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk'. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Nebiyiyo Dan'el b́ keewtsok'on kiimshitu wic'its keewo S'ayin beyokoke b́ need'efere it bek'ore nababirwo man t'iwintsde'e! <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Manoor Yihud datsatse fa'úwots guromats woc'nee. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk'. 17:31</ref></char></note> Maa tokatse fa'o ik jagdek'osh oot'k'aye. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Goshifokon fa'onúwere b́ tah dek'osh shuuts aank'aye, <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Manoor na'i maac'wotsnat na'a s'aatsirwotssh indowe boosha? <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>It giifi aawo jooshonat s'anbati aawon b́woterawok'o Ik'o k'onwere! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Manoor datsu bíazeron tuut hambetsish b́borfetso wotdanawo, shinomaantsowere man artso b́ jamon woteraw gond bek'i eeno wotitwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Aaw manots k'awuno bok'azink'ere ik ashonwor kasho falrawnk'e b́teshi, ernmó marat'ets ashuwotssha err aaw manots k'awnetúne.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>«Manoor asho konúwor wotowa ‹Hambe, Krstosiye hanoke fa'e!› wee ‹ekewoke b́ fa'oni!› itsh bíetal amank'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan. 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Bek'. 7:14</ref></char></note> Kootets Krstosotsnat kootets nebiyiwots tuwitune, bo boosh b́ faleyal Ik'ik marat'etswotsnoor dab́ dariyosh een een adits keewwotsi kitsitunee.<verse eid="MAT 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>«Eshe, keew jaman shin shino itsh keewre, <verse eid="MAT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26-27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luk'. 17:23-24</ref> </char></note> Mansh ‹Ekebe worwotse b́ fa'oni!› itsh bo etal keshk'ayere, ‹Hambe aashts bewokoke b́fa'oni!› bo etal amank'ayere. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Guumo darotse b́p'ark'or aaw keshon túút aaw kindon b́ be'efok'o, ashna'o woonúwere mank'o b́wotiti. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk'. 17:37</ref></char></note> Duuni beyok k'oorwots kakwetúnee.» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos gitlo aanar b́weyi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar. 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk'. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa. 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Hzk'. 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Bek'. 6:12-13</ref> </char>
    </note> «Gond bek'i aaw manotsiyere okoon manoor aaw t'alu wtsitwanee, aashitsunwere bshaano kitsatsane, k'eenwotswere darotse fed's'uwitúnee, darotsi angwotswere shek'etúnee. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10-14">Zek. 12:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bek'. 1:7</ref></char></note> Maniyere il Ash na'o milikito daaratse be'etwe, manoor datsatse fa'a ash naarwots eepetúne. Ash na'onwere angonat een mangon dawnats wotde b́woor bek'etúnee. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>B́ melakiwotsi gaati k'aari eeno bo shishitwk'o b́woshiti, boowere datsatse awd kaaton amr dari daaratse tuur dari daaratse fa'úwotsi bík galdek'ets ashuwotsi kakwitúne.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beles'i mitúú ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk'. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>«Belesi mit jewro dano itsh wotowe, b jaabwots s'uup kisho de botuuworonat b maarwotswere bo átor, manoor k'aawo b́t'intsok'o danfte. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Mank'owere jaman it bek'or ashna'o b́weyi aawo b́karntsok'o dande'ere. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Arikoniye itsh tkeewiri, jaman b́ wotefetsosh and dúri s'oot' jaman besheratse. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Daronat datson beshitke, ti aap'tsonmó besheratse.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo b́ weet aawonat sa'aton konwor b́ danawok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk'. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>«Aawman jangonat sa'atmanmó nihoniyere okoon k'osho daritsi melakiwotsi wotiyalor, naayonu b́wotiyal, konúwor dantso aaliye. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Aze. 6:5-8</ref> </char></note> Noh dúri wottsi naaro, ashna'o b́woorowere mank'o wotitwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Mandúr, t'afits aatsoniyere shino Noh markabuts b́kindfetsosh, ashuwots mafetst, boúshfetst, máátsono dek'ifetsit de'ifetsntni botesh. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:39</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Aze. 7:6-24</ref> </char></note> T'afits aatso waat jametso fok b́dek'fetsosh datso danatsno b́tesh, ashna'o woonúwere arikon mank'oye b́wotiti. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Manoor git ashuwots goshoke towaar finitúno. Iko k'aaú dek'etwe iko oritwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Mááts gitwots towaar dio di'itno, ikú k'aaú dek'etwe, ikú ooritwaniye. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Eshe it doonz egoots b́weetuwok'o it danawotse kup'de korere. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Ernmó han dande'ere, moo doonz t'úwotse aawk'o sa'aton úmp'etso b́ weetwok'o b́ danink'ere, tuur kordek'ank'e b́teshi, b́ moonúwere b́ ishetwok'o k'ayk'rerawnk'e b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:44 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luk'. 12:39-40</ref> </char></note> Mank'o Ashna'o it gawraw sa'aton b́weetwotse k'ande'er beewere.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amanets guutsonat gond guutson ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk'. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>«B́ maa ashuwotssh bo misho balon b́ imetwok'o, b́doonz b́meytsi ashuwotsats b́ naashitwo amanetsonat s'ek guutso kone? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>B́ doonz b́waafere mank'o b́ finefere b́daatsit guutso deereke. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Arikoniye itsh tietri, guutsman b́detsts dets jamatse naashini b́k'ritiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Morrgond guuts manmó, ‹T doonz waraniyere ja'itwee› err gawr <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>bínton finiru b́tohuwotsi jot'o b́ tuwiyal mashtswotsntonwere maar b́ úshetka wotiyal, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Guuts man doonz b́ gawraw aawonat b́danaw sa'atone b́ weeti, <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Guutsman doonz guutso tooko kawlni b́k'riti, b́ hit'onúwere git alberetswotsntone b́ woshiti, manoor eeponat gash k'ashone wotiti.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Baarnana'a tatswotsn ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>Manats dabt Iyesus hank'o etre, «Manoor dari mengstu boc'eesho detsdek't guuyo kotosh keshts baar nana'a tatswotsiye biari. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Boyitse utswots wihno, útswots s'ekno botesh. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Baarnana'a wihiwots bo c'eesho deshbodek'alor c'eeshmansh wotit zeyito k'osh zeyiti k'ac'ots detsde'atsno. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Baar nana'a s'ekwotsmó bo c'eeshonton k'osh zeyito k'ac'ots detsdek'tni botesh. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Guuyman b́ teshtsotse jametswotsats tokr gooro maawt k'eebowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Taali tiits b́wottsok'onmó ‹Hambe, guuyoniye waare! keer de'ere!› etiru wac'ro shisheb́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Manoor baarnana'a jametswots tuut boc'eesho k'anibodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Baar nana'a wihwots s'ekwotssh ‹no c'eeshó tahosh bí etirwotse oona itsha it zeyitatse noosh imere› boet. <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Baarnana'a s'ekwotsmó ‹Noonat itnsh bodet zeyito deshatsone. Maniyere suk'iyomand amŕ itsh wotit zeyito kewde'ere› ett boosh boaaniy. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Baarnana'a wihiyots zeyit kéwo boami, manoor guuyo b́weyi. K'andek't beyiru barbarwots guuyonton jiwosh k'aniyets moonat úshi een moots kindbowtsi, b́ fengeshonúwere is'eeb́wtsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>ili oorts barwots wáát, ‹Doonzono! Doonzono! oona neesha! noosh k'eshwee!› boeti. <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 13:25">Luk'. 13:25</ref> </char></note> Bímó ‹Arikoniye itsh tietiri, taa itn danatse!› ett boosh bíaani. <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Mansh bí aawonat b́ sa'aton it danawotse kup'de korere.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ambaar boosh imets keez guutswotsi ariyetso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk'. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>Iyesus hank'o ett k'osh jewron boosh b́ keew, «Manoor Ik'i mengstots kindi jango hank'owa b́ wotiti, k'osh dats amet ash iko b́ guutswotsi s'eegt b́ detstso boosh bímts naarok'owe bíari. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Doonzo ik ikwotssh bo faltsok'o boosh b́ kayi, ikosh úuts meklityo, ikosh git meklityo, aani ikosh ik meklityo imt k'osh datso maants bí'ami. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Úúts meklityo dek'tso manoor amt́ bín jaakt k'osh úuts meklityo b́ orshi. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Git meklity dek'tso ando mank'o k'osho gitmeklityo oorshb́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Ik meklit dek'tsonmó amt́ datso ishdek't b́ doonz gizo duukb́k'ri. <verse eid="MAT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>Ay aawo b́beshiyak guuts manots doonz waat b́gizo guutsmanotsnton taano dek' b́twu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Úúts meklityo dek'tso b́ doonzok waat úuts meklityo t'intst ‹Doonzono! úuts mekilitiyo taash imrne b́ teshi, hambe! k'osh úts meklitiyo oorshre!› bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>B́ doonzuwere ‹Sheengo finrnee, nee dówónat amanets guutsono! múk' keewatse amanek wotat ndatsetsotse ay keewatse neen naashitwe, waakindr n doonz gene'úo kayde'e!› bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Git meklitiyo dek'tso t'int ‹Doonzono git meklitiyo taash imrne b́teshi, hambe! k'osho git meklitiyo oorshre!› bíet. <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>B́doonzwere ‹Sheenge! nee amanetsonat sheeng guutsono muk' keewatse amanek wotat ndatsetsosh ay keewatse neen naashitwe, wowe ndoonz gune'úo kayde'e› bíet. <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Ik meklitiyo dek'tsonwere t'int, ‹Doonzono! n shohawo k'es'etwo, n bad'irawoke kakuwit, maac'kup' asho nwottsok'oo danfee, <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Mansh shatat amaat ngizoo datso ishdek'at duuktk'ri, hambe ngizooni!› bíet. <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>B́ doonzmó hank'o bíet, ‹Nee gondonat wih guutsono! t shohawoke t k'es'etwok'o t bad'irawoke t kakuwitwok'o n danka wotiyal, <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Tgizo bankiyots gerk'ro neen geyife b́teshi, taa t waatsok'on t gizo b́shuwonton tdek'ank'oni. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Erere ambarman de'er tats mekliti detstsosh imere. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat. 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar. 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk'. 8:18</ref> </char></note> Detsts ashosh dabeetwe bíkonu aytwe, deshaw ashoknomó b́detstso dab de'e wútsetuwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mat. 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luk'. 13:28</ref> </char></note> Woteraw guutsanmó úratsi t'aluwo maants kishde juwore, manokno gash k'ashonat eepon wotitwe.›<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dúr s'uwatse wotit angsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:31 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat. 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19:28</ref> </char>
    </note> «Ash na'o b́ melaki jamwotsn jisheyar mangon b́woor b́magi jorats bedek'etwe, <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Ash jamwots b́ shinats bokoeti, jintso mererwotsi eyshotse b́ galtsok'o bíwere ashuwotsi bo ik iketsatse gal b́dek'eti. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Mererwotsi b́ k'anomaantsan, eyishwotsi b́ giromadan b́ned'iti. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Manoor nuguso b́ k'anomaantse faúwotssh hank'o bíeteti, ‹It tnih deertswotso! woore! datso bí azewori itsh k'ants mengtsto naarde'eree! <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>K'ak'at t teshor taan manzrtee, shashuwat t teshor taash ishrtee, ib wotat twaare it moowotse taan dek'at ibirtee, <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Araatsat tteshoor, taash taakrte, shodat tteshor tshodo fadrte, tip'eyat tteshor wáát taan aatrte.› <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Manoor kááwwots hank'o err bísh aanitune, ‹Doonzono, awure nk'ak'ere bek'aat neesh nomaanzi? Awure nshashwre bek'aat shashuwo neen nokishi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Awure ib n woto bek'aat nee noíbíyi? Awure ni aratsere bek'aat neesh notaki? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Awure nshoore wee ntipere bek'aat waat neen nos'iili?› <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Nugúsonwere ‹Arikone itsh tkeewiri, t eshwanotsitse muk'na'a ikosh itk'alts jamo taash it k'altsok'oyiye!› eton boosh bí aaniyiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>Maniyere il b́ giri aaromantse fa'uootssh hank'o bí eteti, ‹It c'ashetsanotso! tiatse okaan wokoore! Diyablosnat b́ shutsats sha'iru b́ melakiwotsnsh k'aniyets dúre dúri tawo maants ameree! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>K'ak'atniye tteshi taan maanzratste, shashuwaatniye tteshi taan shashuwo kishatste. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Ib wotat waare b́teshi, taan ibiratstee, it mootse araatsatniye tteshi taash takratstee, shodatnu tipeyatnu t teshi taan aatratstee,› <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Bowere ‹Doonzono, k'ak'at wee shashuwat, ib wotat wee aratsat, shodat wee tipeyat ni'ere awre bek'aat neen tep'o no k'azi?› Err aanitune. <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Nugúsonwere ‹Ariko itshi keewirwe, t eshwanotsitse muk'na'a wotts ikosh it k'alk'aztso taash it k'alrawok'oyiye› bíeteti. <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan. 12:2</ref> </char></note> Mansh hanots dúre dúri t'afomand boamor, kááwwotsmó dúre dúri beyo maantsane boameti.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ats malets malo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk'. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Iyesus jam daniyo daniy b́k'rtsok'on b́ danifwotssh hank'o bíeti, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kesh. 12:1-27</ref> </char></note> «Git aawoniyere okoon fazigi baaliyo b́wotitwok'o danfte, Ash na'onwere jitewosh besheyarr imetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Manoor kahni naashwotsnat ashuwotsitse eenashwots kahni naashi naasho K'eyaf múúlotse kakwebowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Manoknowere Iyesusi málon deshde boúd'itwok'o mál bok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Ernmó, «Ashuwots dagotse fayo b́tuurawok'o baaliy aawon wotk'aye» boeti. <verse eid="MAT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Iyesusmó, Bitaniyi datsatse een shodets teshtso Sim'on mootsna b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luk'. 7:37-38</ref> </char></note> Manoknowere Iyesus mishi maratse b́befere mááts ikú b́k'awntso ayidek' shaaw wotts shitúwo bín s'eents albast'rosiya eteets shútson dozets b́lk'at'iyo dek'at b́ maants bt'iini, shitú manowere b́tokats b kuut'i.<verse eid="MAT 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>B́danifwots man bek't fayat hank'o boeti, «Shitúwan eegishe hank'o datsmec'ron b́ t'afiri? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Shitúwan ay gizosh kemeyar t'owwotssh imo faleyank'e b́teshi!» <verse eid="MAT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Iyesuswere hank'o boetirwok'o dank'rat boosh hank'o bíeti, «Máátsani eegoshe it kic'iri? Biye taash sheeng keewo k'alraniye, <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Iwi. 15:11</ref> </char></note> T'owwots úni aawo itoke bofa'oni, taamó jam aawo itnton hanoke beeratse. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Bi shitúwan tiats b kuut'o taan duukeyorish k'aniyoshee. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Arikon itsh keewirwe dats jamatse doo shishiyan b́keewetsoke bi b k'altson bin gawetwok'o bjango keewetwe.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yhud Iyesusi beshidek't imosh maac'o bí ímtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk'. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Manoor tatse gitwotsitse ik wottso Keriyot dats asho Yhud, kahni naashwots maants amt, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zek. 11:12</ref> </char></note> «Iyesusi itsh beshide'er ti imal taash eege it imeti?» bíet. Bowere shaash t'agaro bo imi. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Manoori sa'aton dek' tuut Iyesusi beshide b́imet sheeng aawa b́ geefoni b́tesh.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus ayhdiwots fazigi kooc'misho b́woshefwotsnton b́maatsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk'. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Tush meyi baaliyots shints aawots b́ danifwots Iyesusok t'int «Fazig ba'aliyi kooc' misho aawoke neesh nok'aniytwok'owe ngeyi?» ett boaati. <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Bíwere «Kitots itkindor it daatsit asho galok amr ‹Danifo tiaawo b́t'intsotse t danifwotsnton fazigi kooc'misho t meet nmootsnee etfe› erere» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>B́ danifwots Iyesus boosh bí ettsok'o bok'ali, fazigi kooc' misho bo k'aniyi. <verse eid="MAT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Datso b́iltsok'on Iyesus tatse git woshetswotsnton kooc' mishi marats beeb́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Bomafero Iyesus, «Arikoniye itsh t keewiri, ititsi ikoniye taan beshide imetwe» bí eti. <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>B́ danifwots b́ keewts manatse tuutson aydek't shiyanat ik ikon, doonzono, «Taa wotifta?» ett aato dek' botuwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Dub. 41:9</ref> </char></note> Ieyesuswere hank'o ett boosh bíaani, «Taan beshide imetwoniye taanton tohaat b́kishon sahaniyotse ito itdek'irwoniye. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Ash na'o b́ jangosh guut'etsok'on k'iritwe, ernmó Ash na'o beshide imet ashmansh indowe bína! ash man shuweraniye b́oorink'ee bísh k'anefe b́ teshi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Bín beshide imetwo Yhudwere, «Danifono! taane k'uwa b́ wotiti?» bí eti. Iyesuswere, «Nee nittsok'oyiye» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'ayn mishi jango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk'. 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 K'or. 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Bo mafere Iyesus tushman k'a'údek't b́deeri, tiitsdek't b́ danifwotssh, «Nahere mooree han tmetsoniye» ett boosh bí'imi. <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Wanc'mano k'aúdek'́t Ik'o údon b́ k'oniyakon hank'o ett boosh bí'imi, «It únets wanc'anitse úyeree, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kesh. 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erm. 31:31-34</ref> </char></note> Han ay ash morro oorowe eti jangon taarewosh kuud'it t s'atsoniye. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Tnihi mengstotse weyni shwi fíís' hanedro itnton túshet aawo b́ borfetsosh haniye okoon woyni shuwanatse fíís'otse gitlo úyatse etirwe,» <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Maniye il udi duubo duubt Debre zeyit guri abaats k'az bokeshi.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros bín bíhaaltuwok'o Iyesus shino b́ keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk'. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zek. 13:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor Iyesus, b́ danifwotssh hanek'o bíeti, « ‹Jintso jot'etwee, mereer s'enwotsu bad'ni bowtsiti› ett guut'etsok'on t'uwanitse, it jametsanots taan k'ak'rar tiatse wos'etute. <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat. 28:16</ref> </char></note> Ernmó k'ironiye t tuwiyako itiyere shino Galil datso maants ametuwe.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Manoor P'et'ros, «K'osh jametswots dab neen k'ay boamal taa b́ jamon neen k'ayk'rar woc'atse!» ett b́ keewi. <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Iyesuswere «Arikone neesh tietiri, hambets t'úwaanitse baako b́ k'adfetsosh keezoto taan haalitune» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>P'et'rosmó, «K'ira wotiyalor nenetoni t k'iriti bako b́ jamon neen haaleratse!» bíet. Oorts b́danifwotswere mank'o boet.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Maniyere il Iyesus b́danifwotsnton Getesemaniy eteef beyokok bí ami, manok bobodtsok'on Iyesus b́ danifwotssh «Taa ekewok amr Ik'o t k'onfetsosh it hanoke betere» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Bínton P'et'rosnat Zebdiwos nana'a gitetswots b́ shutsatse dek't bíami, shiyanefetst kic'o dek't b́tuwi. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Hank'owere boosh bíeti «K'iro tborfetsosh shiyanwtsere, it hanoke betere, tantonwere kup'ore.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Boyere muk'i okaan wokat amt́, datsats b́baron gup' gup'dek't, hank'o ett Ik'o b́ k'oni, «Nihono! faleetkawotiyal gondbek'i wanc'an tiyatsere ok beshowe! ernmó nee nshuntsok'owa bako taa t shuntsok'o wotk'aye.»<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Maniyere il b́danif keezwotsok aanat b́ waatsok'on bok'eefere boon b́daatsi, mansh P'et'rossh hank'o bíeti, «Taanton dab ik sa'atush kup'at it tokrerawon beyo falratsteya? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Fadewots it kindrawok'o kup'de'er Ik'o k'onwere, shayiro arikon k'andek'kee, meetsonmó maawke.»<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Ando aani gitlo Iyesus wokdek't amt «T nihono! gondbek'i úshi wanc'an t úyawon b́ besho faleratse wotiyal nee ni ettsok'o wotowe» ett b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Ando aaniyi b́ danifwotsok aani b́ woor bo ááwo tokron maawt b́teshtsotse botookrefere boon b́ daatsi. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Ando aani boon k'azkraat amt shintsman aaniyi keewon keezlo Ik'o b́ k'oni. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Maniyere il b́ danifwotsok waat boosh hank'o bíeti, «Anodoor k'ewoke itfa'oni? kashdek'oke itfa'oni? Hamb ash na'o morretswots kishots beshide'e imet sa'ato bodre, <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Tuuwere amone! hamb taan beshide imetwo t'inree!» <verse eid="MAT 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Iyesus man keewoke b́befere, tatse git b́ danifwotsitse wottso iko Yhud b́weyi, bíntonwere shiki goradonat gumbo kurdek'ts ay ashuwots boweyi, boowere kahniy naashwotsnat eenashwotsoke woshekno botesh. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Iyesusi beshide imetwo Yhud́ ash ashuwotssh «It geyirwoniye taa t joobitwoniye bín deshde'ere» eton milikito imtni b́tesh.<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Yhud manoor waat Iyesusok t'ínt «Danifono! jeeno neesh wotowe!» ett b́ joobi. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Iyesuswere, «T mashono! eshe nwaats kis'o s'eentswe» bíet. Maniyere il ashuwots Iyesusok t'int detsbodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Manoor Iyesusnton teshtswotsitse iko b́ kisho jargt b́ shiki gorado kaas'dek't́ kahani naasho guutso togt b́ waazo b́k'ut'i. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Iyesusmó hanek'owa bíet, «Shik k'aa'utswots shikon bot'afitwotsee nshiko b́batots aani de'er gerk'rowee. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Taa t nihi t k'oniyal bí ay kum kees'et melakiwotsi wosho b́ maawitk'o arefáá itsha? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Mank'oyi wotink'e ‹Gond bek'o bín geyife› etirwo S'ayn mas'afotstsi aap'o aawk'o k'alrniya b́ s'eeneti?»<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:55 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk'. 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoori sa'ator, manoke ko'ets ash ashosh Iyesus hank'owa bíet, «Wonbedewo detsfwotskok'oye taan detsosh shikonat gumbon detsdekat it weyi? Aaw aawon Ik' mootse itn danifetsat itnton tbeyor taan deshatste b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Ernmó jaman b́wotir nebiywotsn guut'etso b́s'eenetwok'owe.» Manoor b́ danif jametswots bín k'azk'rat bowos'i.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus angshfwotsok dek't ametsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk'. 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh. 18:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:19-24">14:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Maniyakon Iyesusi detsdek'ts ashuwots kahni naasho K'eyaafok dek't boami, manoknowere nem danifwotsnat eenash eenashwots kakuweyatni botesh. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>P'et'rosmóó kaahniywots naasho múúlok b́borfetso Iyesus jafrats wokoon sha'o b́ tuwi, biitsowere kinddek't keewman b́s'uufetso bek'osh múúl kotirwotsntoon be b́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Kahini naashwotsnat ayhudiwots moosh mooshif jametswots Iyesus ats k'iro angshosh kooti gawo bogeyiri. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Kooti gaw gawiru aywots bí ats bot'iinalor, k'iro bí ats angshit gawo daatsratsno, il gaw gitetswots t'int, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref> </char></note> «Ashaan ‹Ik'iko Ik' moo gaahde keez aawotse agosh falitwe› etre» ett bokeewi.<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Kahniwots naashonwere tuut «Ashaanots ni aats bo gawiru jamansh eegor boosh aaniyalkneneya?» ett bíaat. <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Iyesusmo s'ik et b́wtsi. Kahniwotsatsi naashonwere aaniy Iyesussh «Beyat beyiru Ik'o shúútson neen taarirwe! nee Ik'o naay Krstosi nwoto noosh keewwe!» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan. 7:13</ref> </char></note> Iyesuswere bísh hank'o bíet, «Nee níettsok'oyiye, ernmó haniyak ash na'o bí jam falts Ik'o k'ani aaromantse b́befere bek'etute, aaninwere mank'o darotse daawnatse wotde b́woor bek'etute etirwe.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Manoor kahniwotsatsi naasho nib k'úúnon b́ taho gaat't hank'o bíet, «Hamb Ik'e b́ c'ashiriye! b́ c'ashirwonowere it shishrte! haniyere bogo eeg gawe b́geyiti! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:66 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lew. 24:16</ref> </char></note> Eshe, itsh eeg arefa?» boowere «K'ire bísh wotitiye!» ett boaaniyi.<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Manoor bo s'udo bíats bos'udi, bín bok'is'i, b́ k'eelatsowere jabefetst. <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>«Krstoso! kone neen jot'tsoní? aab bek'on keewwe» boetiri botesh.<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'et'ros Iyesusi bíhaltsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk'. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>P'et'ros mooniyere úratse kahni naashwots k'aab naasho múúlotsna b́beyiri b́tesh, manoor gon iku b́ maants t'iinat «Nee weree Gelil datstso Iyesusntoniye n teshiye!» bí et. <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Bímó, «Nietirwo danatse!» eton jami shinatse jamere bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Keshosh fengeshomaand bí amfere gon k'oshu bek'k'rat manoke teshts ashuwotssh, «Ashaan Nazrettso Iyesusntoniye b́ teshi!» biet. <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>P'et'roswere «Ni etiru ashman danatse!» ett taaron aani b́ jamere bíet. <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Muk'i boteshihakon manoke need'dek't teshts ashuwots P'et'rosok t'iindek't «N noon keew keewo danifee, arikon neewor boyitse iko neene» boeti. <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Manoor P'et'ros, «Taa han danatse!» et fetst b́tooko c'ashfetst taaro dek't b́tuwi. Manoor baako b́ k'adi.<verse eid="MAT 26:74"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>P'et'roswere, «Baako b́ k'adfetso keezoto taash bín danatse jamere etetune» ett Iyesus b́ keewts aap'o gaw b́dek'i. Úrats kesht s'aamts eepo bí eepi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi P'ilat'osok dek't ametsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk'. 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoh. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Guur datsgatson kahni naashwotsnat dats eenash jametswots Iyesus ats b́k'iritwok'o angshosh boshiyeyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Maniyak Iyesusi tipdek' amt dats k'eezirwo P'ilat'ossh beshidek't boími.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Iyesusats angshetsok'o b́ bek'tsok'on bín beshi dek't imtso Yhud b́goyni, shaash t'agoronowere kahni naashwotsnat eenashwotssh hank'o ett aani b́k'ri, <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>«Ash s'ayino k'irosh beshidek'at t imtsotse morro finere.» Boomó «Eshe noon eege giri! man n took kis'e!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Bíwere shaash t'agarman Ik' moots bad'ik'rat, bowoke k'az b́keshi, amtnwe guuk'at k'ir b́úwts. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Kahani naashwotswere shaash t'agar man k'aaúdek't «Ambaran s'atsi giz b́wottsotse Ik' mootse ko'íyeyiru gizots eeko nemon baziyeke» boet. <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Mansh bo shiyeyakon ibwotsi dukosh b́ wotisha ett shal wozirwooke datso bokeewi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3-8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Wosh. 1:18-19</ref> </char></note> Manatse tuutson datsman andish bodt «S'ats datsa» ett b́s'egeyiri.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Han jangatse tuutson «Esra'el nanaúwots bo k'oortsok'on bísh wotitwo shaash t'agaro bodek', <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9-10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zek. 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-10">Erm. 32:6-10</ref> </char></note> Doonzonwe taan bíazaztsok'on shal wozet datsi k'awntso dashbok'ri» ett nebiyo Ermiyas bek'on b́keewtso b́s'eeni.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus P'ilat'os shinats b́t'intsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk'. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoh. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Manoor Iyesus dats k'eeziru P'ilat'os shinats b́t'iini, dats k'ezirwonwere «Nee ayhudiyots naasho neeneya?» Ett bíaati, Iyesuswere «Nee ni'ettsok'oyiye» ett bí aani.<verse eid="MAT 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Ernmó kahni naashwotsnat eenashwotsn bín s'amiyosh bo etor eegor aaniratse.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Maniyak P'ilat'os «Ay keewon neen bos'amirúwan shiyatsneya?» bí eti.<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Iyesusmó dats k'eezirwo ayidek't bí adfetsosh bín bos'aamiru keewosh eegoru aaniratse.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusats k'iro angshetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar. 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk'. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoh. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Dats k'eezirwo woriwot woriwoton ayhudiyots fazigi worwot baloyon tipetswotsitse noosh bishowe err boaatfwotsitse iko b́shde'e faksho bo nema b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Manoor «Barbani»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ik ik kishon gut'tetswots </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Iyesus Barbani </char><char style="ft">Etirwo dabfno. </char></note> eteets gond finon daneets tipetso fa'e b́ tesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Manoor ashuwots ko'ebowtsere P'ilat'os, «Koni itsh t biitse it geyi? Berbannemó Krstosi eteyrwo Iyesusne?» ett boon bí aati. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Hank'o b́ etts jangonwee okooron bín beshidek't boimirwok'o b́ dantsosha b́ teshi. <verse eid="MAT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Manoor P'ilat'os b́ angshi jooratse b́ befere b́ moo gen, «B́ jangosh hmbets t'ú taa gúmotse aydek'at tikic'tsotse ash s'aynmanats eegoru nk'alrawok'owa» etaat bwoshi. <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Manoor kahani naashwotsnat eenash eenashwotsn «Barban bishowe! Iyesus úd'ewe!» err bo aatitwok'o ashuwotssh boizi. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Dats k'ezirwonu, «Gitetswotsitse aawi itsh t bitsishe itgeyri?» ett ashuwotsi b́ aati. «Bowere Berbani noosh bíshe» bo eti. <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>P'lat'oswere «Eshe Krstosi eteetso Iyesusi aak'owe nok'aliti?» bíet. Jamwotswere «Jitewe!» ett boaani. <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Dats k'ezirwonu eegishe? «Bí b́ t'afitso eebi?» bíet. Boomó «Jitewe!» ett aydek't bokuhi. <verse eid="MAT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Iwi. 21:6-9</ref> </char></note> Hansh P'ilat'os keewan faye b́tiziti bako egoshoru b́ k'alrawok'o b́ bek'tsotse, manoor aatso de'eweetwok'o k'alt «Taa ashaan s'atsotse s'ayn taane, b́ s'atso it tokatse?» ett ashuwots shinatse b́kisho b́mashi.<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Ash jamwotswere «B́ s'atso noonat nona'ats wotowe» boet.<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Manoor P'lat'os Barbani bitsdek't faksh b́k'r, Iyesusnmó b́ jot'iyakon b́ jiteyish beshidek't boosh b́ ími.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kes' kes'fuwots Iyesusats tirgic'o bo kashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Manoor dats k'eezirwo kes'fwots Iyesusi dats k'eziruman múlo maantsan dek't boami, kes'f jamwots Iyesusi gúrdek't ko'eebowtsi. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>B́ tahono kishbazt tah bíro takbok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Angitson shordek't dozets akliliya eteetso b́ tookats jip'ii bok'ri, b́ k'ani kishats gumbo detsik'rat, b́shinats tuk'mal dek't «Ayhudiyotsko nugusono! jeeno neesh wotowe!» ett bí ats nic'o bokaashi. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Bos'udono bíats bos'udfera boteshi, b́ kishatsenowere gumbo k'aaúdek't b́ took tookats bojot'fera botesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Bíats tirgic'o bo kaashiyakono tah biro kishbazt b́took taho takdek't, jitosh dek't bo ami.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ jitetsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk'. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Dats keewirwo múúlotse keshoke bobefere Simoni eteefo K'erena eteets dats asho daatsdek't Iyesus mask'aliyo shefdek't b́kuritwok'o bowshi. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Maniyere il b́bitsonwere «Took k'oola» eteef beyokok bobodi. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Maniyeokon úmonton eekets weyni biro b́ úshetwok'o Iyesussh t'ints bok'ri, ernmó bí fadbek't úsho geeratse b́tesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Dub. 22:18</ref> </char></note> Iyesusi bojitiyakon b́ tahats it'o shap't kaybodek'i. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Manoknowere bedek'tni bín bokotfere botesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Bín s'amiyetsok'o kitsitwo, «Han ayhdiwots nugúso Iyesusiye?» Etirwo guut'etso b́ mask'aliy k'oyok gedbok'ri. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Manoor Iyesusnton git wonbedewotsi iko k'ano maants iko giro maants jit bok'ri.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:39 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:7">Dub. 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ ganoke beshefts teshts ashuwotswere gac'on botoko shek'efetst <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh. 2:19</ref> </char></note> «Nee Ik' k'oni moo gaahr keez aawotse agetuwonoo! aab n tooko kashiwe! Ik'o naayi n wotiyal aab mask'aliyatse ood'e!» eton bíats bokashfera botesh.<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Mank'o kahniy naashwots nemo danifwotsntoonat eenashwotsnton hank'o ett bíats bokaashfere botesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«K'oshwotsi kashire, b́tooknmó kashiyo falratse! bí Israe'el nugúsoni wotiyal aab mask'aliyatse ood'e, noowere bín amanone! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Dub. 22:8</ref> </char></note> Bí Ik'ats amanere, ‹Ik'o naay taane› etre, eshe Ik'o bín shunfee wotiyal and aab bín fariwe!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Ando mank'o bínton jitets wombediwots bín boc'ashfera botesh.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus K'iro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk'. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Shirt sa'aton b́tuutso jed'isa'ato b́ borfetso dats jamatse t'alu wotb́gutsi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Jed'i sa'at b́ wottsok'oon Iyesus, «Elohe! elohe! lama sebek'tani?» eton k'aari eenon b́ kuhi, b́bitsonwere «T Ik'ono! t Ik'ono! eegishe taan k'aznk'ri?» eta. <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Manoke need'dek't teshts ashuwotsitse man shisht «Hanwo Eliyasiye b́ s'eegiri!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Dub. 69:21</ref> </char></note> Manoor boyitsi iko sefnegiya eteetso dek'wat shash keewo bíts s'eentsdek't gumbats geddek't Iyesus b́úshetwok'o t'intsb́k'ri. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>K'oshwotsmó «Need'owe aab́ Eliyas waar bín kashitwe wotiyal be'one!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Iyesus aaniy een k'ááron kuhat b́ kasho b́ ími.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:51 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kesh. 26:31-33</ref> </char>
    </note> Manoor Ik'i meyitsi magarajiwo dambe dek't dash b́ borfetso gaad'at gitoko kayb́wts, datsonwere shek'eb́wtsi, shúts s'aalwotswere kap'ebowtsi, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Dowwotswere bok'eshere k'irt teshts S'ayin ash aywots k'irotse botuwi. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Dowootse keshtnwere Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuwiyakon S'ayn kitu Iyerusalemits bokindi, manokno ay ashuwotsats bobe'eyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Balatsi naashonat bínton beyirwotsn Iyesusi kotirowots dats giwonat manoke wotts jamman bobek'tsok'on aydek't shatt «Arikon han Ik'o naayiye b́ teshi!» boet. <verse eid="MAT 27:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Wokoon wotdek't man s'iliru ay máátswots manoke fa'ano botesh, boowere Geliln tuut Iyesussh finefetst b́ shutsats bosha'efera boteshi. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:56 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luk'. 8:2-3</ref> </char></note> Boyitsnowere megdelawiti eteetsu Mariyamna Yak'obnat Yosef ind mariymna Zebdiyos nanaúwots indna manoke fa'úwotsi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesusi dukeewo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk'. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Datso b́ iliyakono Yosefi eteets asho Armatiyas eteets kitutse gaalets ash iko manok b́weyi, bíwere Iyesus danifwotsitska b́ tesh. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Ashmanwere, P'ilat'os maantsan amt Iyesus duuno b́ k'oni, P'ilat'oswere duunman bísh imetwok'o b́azazi. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Manoor Yosef duunman orshdekt shemi s'aynon k'odb́k'r. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>B́ tookish shúts s'alotse k'ewdek't b́dozts doowi handrots duukb́k'r, shúts eeno kukulshdek't doowi fengeshats is'k'rat kazbíami. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Megdelawi dats ashu Mariyamnat k'oshu Mariyamn, manoke doowi shinatse bobefere boteshi.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>K'andek'i aawoniyere yaatsok'o guur, kahni naashwotsnat feresawiyotsn ik wotdek' P'ilat'os maantsan amt hank'o boeti, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>«Doonzono! dariifmań kashon befetst ‹Keez aawoniye okoon k'irotse tuwitwe› bíettso gawdek'rone. <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Mansh b́ danifuwots amr úmp'de ashuwotssh ‹Hamb k'irotse tuure› boerawok'o doowman keez aawo b́ borfetso kotetwok'o azazowe, man wotob́k'azal ili b́dariytwo shintsoniyere ayide gonde b́ wotiti.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>P'ilat'oswer «Hambe, kotet kes'fwots fa'ane, de'amr it dantsok'on kotiwere» bíet. <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Mansh amt shútsmanats matabon togk'rat doowman kes'fuwotsn bokoti.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus k'irotse b́ tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk'. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Sambato b́ beshiyakon ik gawiyotsi shínts aawots Sanbata gudots guur goyoon Megdel dats ash wottsu Mariyamnat Mariyam k'oshun b́ dowu man s'ilosh boami. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Mann, gawerawo datso ayidek't shek'e b́wutsi, melakiyo darotse oot'wat doowo bín is'eets shútso kukulshk'rat bí'abats be b́dek'i. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Ik' melakiman shiitsonwere guumok'owa b́goliri b́teshi, b́tahonwe shetsok'o nas'a b́teshi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Kotirwotsu melakiyo bo shattsotse k'ewat duunok'o wotbowtsi, <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Melakiyonmó máátswotssh hank'o bíet, «Itiyere shatk'ayere, jitetso Iyesusi it geyrwok'o danfee, <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Bíwere hanoke aaliye shin b́ keewtsok'on k'azturee. Hanoke aaliye, b́ duukewoko waar s'iilere. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Eshe kaari amr b́danifwotssh ‹K'irotse tuure! hamb, Gelil maantsan itiyere shino amree, manoke bín daatsitute!› err boosh keewwere, eshe itsh keewre.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Maniyere hakon máátswots shatonat ayidek't een geneewoon doowokere kááron k'az boami, b́danifwotssh keewosh bowos'i.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Iyesus weerindatse boon daatst «Jeeno itsh wotowe!» bíet. Bowere b́ maantsan t'int b́ tufo detsdek't bísh bosagadi. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Manoor Iyesus, «Shatk'ayere! amr Gelil maants boametuwok'o ti eshwotssh keewwere, taan bo bek'etuweree bíyokne» bíet.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Máátsmanotsu amoke bobefere kes'irwotsitse ik ikuwots kitots amt́ wotts jam keewman kahani naashwotssh bokeewi. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Kahni naashwtsnat eenashwotsn ko'eyat boshiyeyakon kes'fwotssh ay ambaro imt hank'o boeti, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>«Noo k'eyoke nobeferee b́ danifwots t'úwon waat úmp'dek't bo ami err ash ashuwotssh keewwere. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Han dats k'eezirwo b́shishetkawotiyal no keewman jango bísh keewr itats gond keewo b́warawok'o woshitwone.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Manoor kes'fwots ambaro k'a'údek't boosh keewetsok'o bok'ali, keewanu hambetsish b́ borfetso ayhudiyotsoke b́keeweyiri.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus b́ danifwotssh b́ be'etsok'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk'. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Wosh. 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:3-8">1 K'or. 15:3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>B́ danif tatse ikwotswere Iyesus bo amish boosh b́kitstso, Geliln fa'a guromadan boami. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Bín bobek'tsok'on bísh bosagadi, ik ikuwotsu amanobok'azi, <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Iyesusu bowok t'int hank'o bíet, «Al jamo datsatsnowe daratsnowere taash imk'rere <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Datsatsi ash jamok amr, nihon, naayonat shayiri S'ayno shútson boon gufr t danifwotsi woshweree. <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Taa itn tiazazts jaman bok'alitwok'o boosh daniwere! eshe taa datsu besho b́borfetso jam aawo itntoniye tfaooniyee.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
